WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.966
BON APPÉTIT, YOUR MAJESTY

2
00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.385
-[pounding]
-[pants]

3
00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:54.596
-[moans]
-Go on. Ask her why she's so mad.

4
00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:56.723
-Gosh. How am I to know that?
-What is this?

5
00:00:56.806 --> 00:01:00.226
-What has gotten into her all of a sudden?
-[yells] You're all gonna die! [pants]

6
00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.146
What on earth is that pounding sound?

7
00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.899
There is no more quiet here.

8
00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.485
I guess the performers
must have been summoned again.

9
00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.112
Gosh. And the whole palace is
in disarray already.

10
00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:12.489
I bet it's not them though.

11
00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.990
Is this your first day in the palace?

12
00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.076
The performers would be here.

13
00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:17.160
We should hurry.

14
00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.995
We need to cook the breakfast,

15
00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:20.914
before we get scolded for being late.
Okay?

16
00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:23.083
CHOJOBAN: EARLY MORNING MEAL
THAT USUALLY INCLUDES SOOTHING FOOD

17
00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.542
[sighs] All right.

18
00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:25.919
[pounding continues]

19
00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:37.013
[clears throat]
Why are you pounding the fish that way?

20
00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.807
You are frightening me, d-doing that.

21
00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:43.520
[horror movie music plays]

22
00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.438
-[screech sound effect]
-[gasps]

23
00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:46.773
You're finally here.

24
00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:49.234
[chuckles]

25
00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.779
-[pounding resumes]
-She's not stopped going at that fish.

26
00:01:52.862 --> 00:01:55.406
Just hitting it. All night.
She will not stop.

27
00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:58.952
I, uh, I need to go visit Saongwon,
so I will go now.

28
00:01:59.035 --> 00:02:00.078
[clears throat]

29
00:02:00.161 --> 00:02:03.998
-Oh, uh, well, then I'll go with you.
-Uh, wait, Man-su!

30
00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:05.917
Now I remember,
I think we're short on firewood.

31
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.044
Uh-oh, we cannot run out of firewood.

32
00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.129
I will help.

33
00:02:10.338 --> 00:02:12.507
-Screw this! [pants]
-[yelps]

34
00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:13.758
Your face is like…

35
00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.178
It looks all haggard.
What has happened, miss?

36
00:02:17.262 --> 00:02:19.389
You can say what is going on here.

37
00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.765
Hey.

38
00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.392
It's just us two now. Okay?

39
00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.769
So hurry up and tell me. What is wrong?

40
00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:28.439
-[yells] You're dead to me!
-[exclaims] Oh, my goodness!

41
00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.448
Do I really have to make hangover soup
for that guy? Huh?

42
00:02:38.116 --> 00:02:41.077
And there's no chili powder anywhere here.

43
00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.245
[yells]

44
00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:46.499
It died twice, I guess.
The poor little pollack.

45
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:50.670
Come on, miss. Can you tell me
what you're trying to cook? Huh?

46
00:02:51.212 --> 00:02:52.213
Huh?

47
00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:55.800
I was going to make
dried pollack hangover soup,

48
00:02:55.884 --> 00:02:58.303
however, beating it isn't very graceful.

49
00:02:58.386 --> 00:02:59.596
-Is it?
-No.

50
00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:03.099
I'm afraid that it is not. Goodness.

51
00:03:03.182 --> 00:03:04.767
Gil-geum, take the rolling pin.

52
00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:06.603
Huh. Yeah?

53
00:03:08.438 --> 00:03:10.148
Next… [sighs]

54
00:03:10.231 --> 00:03:13.526
…I will crush all the little bits
and pulverize it.

55
00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:17.655
Yeah. I am gonna crush you!

56
00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:19.824
[yelling]

57
00:03:19.908 --> 00:03:21.034
[yells]

58
00:03:21.117 --> 00:03:22.785
[roaring sound effect]

59
00:03:24.454 --> 00:03:26.122
[panting]

60
00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:31.127
SNOWFLAKE SCHNITZEL

61
00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:33.838
[sighs]

62
00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:36.841
[Mal-im] Your Majesty,
your breakfast is ready to be served.

63
00:03:36.925 --> 00:03:38.343
You can enter.

64
00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:56.236
YI HEON
KING OF JOSEON

65
00:03:57.528 --> 00:03:58.905
Your Majesty, are you all right?

66
00:03:58.988 --> 00:04:00.531
You are here? [chuckles]

67
00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:02.784
[gulps, sighs]

68
00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:11.125
[sighs]

69
00:04:13.002 --> 00:04:15.171
To cure your hangover
after you drank yesterday,

70
00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:18.383
I've prepared a dried pollack consommé
to help Your Majesty.

71
00:04:18.466 --> 00:04:19.759
A FRENCH-STYLE CLEAR SOUP

72
00:04:22.345 --> 00:04:26.474
[traditional Asian music plays]

73
00:04:26.557 --> 00:04:28.434
[grunts]

74
00:04:28.518 --> 00:04:29.852
Pollock-con so-me?

75
00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:31.312
Yes.

76
00:04:31.896 --> 00:04:34.315
It's a French-style soup
made with dried pollack.

77
00:04:36.859 --> 00:04:38.111
Oh.

78
00:04:38.194 --> 00:04:40.238
A soup with dried pollack.

79
00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:42.448
-You will taste it.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

80
00:04:50.039 --> 00:04:53.918
-[traditional Asian music plays]
-[sighs]

81
00:04:54.002 --> 00:04:55.545
CHOI MAL-IM
KING'S SENIOR COURT LADY

82
00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.525
[chuckles]

83
00:05:18.359 --> 00:05:19.569
[chuckles]

84
00:05:21.529 --> 00:05:23.406
Um, hang on.

85
00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.700
Did you not say it was dried pollack soup?

86
00:05:25.783 --> 00:05:28.411
So where did all the dried pollack go?

87
00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:31.289
I made it easier for you to eat.
I crushed it up before adding it in.

88
00:05:31.372 --> 00:05:32.665
-You're welcome.
-[gulps]

89
00:05:32.749 --> 00:05:33.875
Please have some more.

90
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:35.877
Go on.
See if you feel anything poking you.

91
00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.129
Nothing will, though. I'm sure.

92
00:05:38.212 --> 00:05:39.714
[sighs]

93
00:05:39.797 --> 00:05:43.426
Everyone may be excused,
except the chief royal cook.

94
00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:45.595
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

95
00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.597
-[door opens]
-[footsteps depart]

96
00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:53.227
[Yi Heon sighs]

97
00:05:54.937 --> 00:05:57.565
Did, um, something happen last night
that I do not know?

98
00:05:57.648 --> 00:05:58.733
[laughs]

99
00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.819
[sighs] I was just about to ask you that.

100
00:06:03.988 --> 00:06:07.325
You don't remember
anything you did at all?

101
00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:11.829
Well, I was drinking a bit and then…

102
00:06:12.497 --> 00:06:13.623
And then what?

103
00:06:14.582 --> 00:06:16.250
Well, you drink to forget things.

104
00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:18.795
So I suppose I do not recall.

105
00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:20.880
Ah, you're telling me that

106
00:06:20.963 --> 00:06:24.801
you have completely forgotten everything
that happened with us last night?

107
00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:27.470
Whoa. You are overstepping there.

108
00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:29.138
Why do you keep asking anyway?

109
00:06:30.932 --> 00:06:32.517
"Please just stay still.

110
00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:35.895
For a moment."

111
00:06:37.772 --> 00:06:40.858
-You still don't know?
-What, um… Know what?

112
00:06:40.942 --> 00:06:41.943
[sighs]

113
00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:45.154
It's a bit awkward to explain it further.
[chuckles]

114
00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:46.405
You're done, right?

115
00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.408
Why are you acting this way?

116
00:06:49.992 --> 00:06:51.661
Please speak straightforward.

117
00:06:54.372 --> 00:06:55.373
[grunts]

118
00:06:55.456 --> 00:06:56.457
Your Majesty.

119
00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:59.794
I would like to clarify
one small thing to you now.

120
00:06:59.877 --> 00:07:02.964
You're not my type,
even in the slightest way, all right?

121
00:07:03.047 --> 00:07:04.882
I'm not your what?

122
00:07:04.966 --> 00:07:08.761
Are you serious? You are not my type.
What one prefers in the other.

123
00:07:08.845 --> 00:07:10.638
And you, Your Majesty,

124
00:07:10.721 --> 00:07:13.057
you do not have any qualities
that I look for in a guy.

125
00:07:13.141 --> 00:07:14.142
[scoffs]

126
00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:16.519
Have you forgotten?

127
00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:19.730
All you are is my chief royal cook.

128
00:07:19.814 --> 00:07:25.695
Which means that I consider you to
never go seen or viewed as a woman here.

129
00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:26.988
[scoffs]

130
00:07:27.071 --> 00:07:28.281
That's good to hear.

131
00:07:28.364 --> 00:07:31.033
So then,
is that all you wanted to clarify?

132
00:07:31.117 --> 00:07:32.118
[scoffs]

133
00:07:32.201 --> 00:07:34.078
I've truly had enough of this.

134
00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:35.163
[laughs]

135
00:07:35.246 --> 00:07:36.330
I'll keep it short and sweet.

136
00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:37.415
Understand…

137
00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:40.418
that, from now on, keep your mouth…
I mean…

138
00:07:40.501 --> 00:07:43.171
Be mindful of how much you drink at night,
all right?

139
00:07:43.754 --> 00:07:44.964
All right. I will

140
00:07:45.756 --> 00:07:47.383
be more careful when I am drinking.

141
00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:48.551
[sighs]

142
00:07:51.387 --> 00:07:54.182
-Take the table.
-[servants] Yes, Your Majesty.

143
00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:09.489
[scoffs]

144
00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:12.742
She is truly being…

145
00:08:13.367 --> 00:08:14.577
[sighs]

146
00:08:16.245 --> 00:08:17.413
[clicks tongue]

147
00:08:17.997 --> 00:08:18.998
[grunts]

148
00:08:20.082 --> 00:08:21.083
Chang-seon.

149
00:08:23.377 --> 00:08:24.962
CHANG-SEON
CHIEF EUNUCH OF ROYAL FOOD

150
00:08:25.046 --> 00:08:26.547
You called, Your Majesty?

151
00:08:27.465 --> 00:08:28.674
Last night at Unyeongjeong,

152
00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:31.260
what exactly happened
to the chief royal cook?

153
00:08:37.058 --> 00:08:40.394
Last night, the chief royal cook…

154
00:08:40.478 --> 00:08:41.854
The chief royal cook?

155
00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.481
She, uh…

156
00:08:43.564 --> 00:08:44.899
[grunts]

157
00:08:46.108 --> 00:08:48.319
Had been kissed by Your Majesty.

158
00:08:50.696 --> 00:08:51.697
[gasps]

159
00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:55.201
I kissed the chief royal cook?
When I was drinking?

160
00:08:57.578 --> 00:08:59.539
[Ji-young] Tonight I've-- [gasps]

161
00:08:59.622 --> 00:09:00.998
Please stay still.

162
00:09:01.082 --> 00:09:02.250
[gasps]

163
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:03.334
Your Majesty…

164
00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:05.336
-[gasps]
-Stay like this.

165
00:09:05.419 --> 00:09:07.338
Just for a moment.

166
00:09:07.421 --> 00:09:08.548
[gasps]

167
00:09:13.052 --> 00:09:14.512
-[gasps]
-[laughs]

168
00:09:14.595 --> 00:09:16.514
You don't remember
anything you did at all?

169
00:09:16.597 --> 00:09:17.848
Be mindful from now on,

170
00:09:17.932 --> 00:09:20.142
of how much you drink at night, all right?

171
00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:23.354
What on earth shall I do about this?

172
00:09:24.689 --> 00:09:25.815
[sighs]

173
00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:28.484
It would be convenient for both of us
to pretend it never happened.

174
00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:33.906
No. I should appease her since I acted in
such a way towards the chief royal cook.

175
00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:34.991
Hold on.

176
00:09:35.741 --> 00:09:36.742
Why am I

177
00:09:37.535 --> 00:09:39.287
worrying over this sort of thing?

178
00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.414
I am the king of this land,

179
00:09:41.497 --> 00:09:43.791
and Cook Yeon is merely
the chief royal cook.

180
00:09:43.874 --> 00:09:44.875
[scoffs]

181
00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.838
It grows more absurd
the more I even think about it.

182
00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:50.923
[clicks tongue]

183
00:09:59.557 --> 00:10:01.058
[clears throat, clicks tongue]

184
00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:03.728
[Ji-young] He seriously doesn't remember?

185
00:10:03.811 --> 00:10:07.481
[sighs] You seriously have to be
freaking kidding me. This jerk.

186
00:10:08.274 --> 00:10:10.234
[sighs] I get that he blacked out,

187
00:10:10.318 --> 00:10:13.446
but still how can he be so shameless
about that sort of thing?

188
00:10:13.529 --> 00:10:15.823
I didn't even expect
an apology or anything.

189
00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:18.159
[sighs] This is absolutely insane.

190
00:10:18.242 --> 00:10:19.952
[Gong-gil] Something on your mind?

191
00:10:21.495 --> 00:10:24.832
Why are you over there
just grumbling endlessly?

192
00:10:24.915 --> 00:10:26.000
[Ji-young] Uh…

193
00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:28.461
Who are you? Do I know you?

194
00:10:28.544 --> 00:10:29.962
GONG-GIL - YEONHUIGUN'S JESTER
WITH MANY SECRETS

195
00:10:30.046 --> 00:10:31.922
Hold on. You honestly do not know?

196
00:10:32.006 --> 00:10:33.799
Well, I wouldn't be asking if I did.

197
00:10:33.883 --> 00:10:37.094
I mean,
you don't exactly look like a new cook.

198
00:10:37.178 --> 00:10:38.971
[sighs]

199
00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:44.769
[harp strumming]

200
00:10:44.852 --> 00:10:46.646
[Ji-young] Whoa. What are you doing?

201
00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:53.194
Oh, you're the jester from before.

202
00:10:53.861 --> 00:10:54.904
Gong-gil?

203
00:10:54.987 --> 00:10:55.988
That's right.

204
00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:59.617
I apologize for when we met
and my behavior.

205
00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:00.701
Tell me, then.

206
00:11:01.744 --> 00:11:04.163
Are you here to trick me again
with your so-called dancing?

207
00:11:04.246 --> 00:11:05.247
[scoffs]

208
00:11:05.331 --> 00:11:07.792
Well, since I last saw you, I have been

209
00:11:08.876 --> 00:11:11.170
assigned as the new
chief royal cook of the palace.

210
00:11:11.253 --> 00:11:13.297
The junior sixth-rank, I believe.

211
00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:15.216
Jaebu.

212
00:11:15.299 --> 00:11:17.093
Oh, wow. How frightening.

213
00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.220
Junior sixth-rank, Jaebu.

214
00:11:19.303 --> 00:11:20.596
[laughing]

215
00:11:21.764 --> 00:11:22.848
What's funny?

216
00:11:23.349 --> 00:11:24.558
I'm giving you a warning right now.

217
00:11:24.642 --> 00:11:26.102
All right. All right.

218
00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:29.355
Understood. I hear you loud and clear.

219
00:11:29.438 --> 00:11:30.606
[scoffs]

220
00:11:30.689 --> 00:11:33.943
Oh. By the way,
how is that court lady fairing?

221
00:11:34.026 --> 00:11:35.861
What was her name again? Gil-geum?

222
00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:39.240
Someone just knocked me over with their
arm and… [exclaims] …I hit the ground.

223
00:11:39.323 --> 00:11:42.493
But then a man appeared
and shouted at the culprit.

224
00:11:42.576 --> 00:11:45.621
The guy was Gong-gil.
He's that handsome jester.

225
00:11:46.705 --> 00:11:47.706
Ah.

226
00:11:48.249 --> 00:11:51.001
Yes. Gil-geum is doing well for herself.

227
00:11:51.627 --> 00:11:54.755
Did you see the culprit
or know who it was?

228
00:11:55.464 --> 00:11:57.091
-I don't know.
-Darn.

229
00:11:57.174 --> 00:11:58.384
However,

230
00:11:59.468 --> 00:12:01.178
the person was in court lady clothes.

231
00:12:01.262 --> 00:12:03.472
I caught a glimpse of
the hem of her skirt.

232
00:12:03.556 --> 00:12:04.974
A court lady? [gasps]

233
00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:06.434
Wait, who the heck would do--

234
00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:10.104
Tell Gil-geum to be very careful
around here for the time being.

235
00:12:10.855 --> 00:12:11.856
Yes, sure.

236
00:12:11.939 --> 00:12:14.692
Gil-geum is grateful for
what you did that day.

237
00:12:14.775 --> 00:12:16.444
Ah, please. It was nothing.

238
00:12:17.111 --> 00:12:20.072
I saw it while I was
searching for someone. That's all.

239
00:12:20.156 --> 00:12:21.699
-Who were you looking for?
-[shushes]

240
00:12:23.033 --> 00:12:24.785
Ignorance is for your own good.

241
00:12:25.286 --> 00:12:26.287
Yeah.

242
00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.038
So, farewell.

243
00:12:28.122 --> 00:12:31.459
I will see you next time,
Chief Royal Cook.

244
00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:33.377
[laughs]

245
00:12:33.461 --> 00:12:34.628
What was that?

246
00:12:34.712 --> 00:12:37.423
Wow. People are
seriously weird around here.

247
00:12:38.007 --> 00:12:39.967
Really not used to this at all.

248
00:12:43.971 --> 00:12:45.639
[screams, grunts]

249
00:12:46.849 --> 00:12:48.517
[Gong-gil] Who are you?

250
00:13:10.539 --> 00:13:13.792
[troupe leader] They dragged her away to
Jahongwon and she came back dead.

251
00:13:13.876 --> 00:13:16.712
And all of this is all because of
that damn king!

252
00:13:16.795 --> 00:13:17.838
[crying]

253
00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:20.549
[young Gong-gil] They said you get
to live comfortably at the palace

254
00:13:20.633 --> 00:13:24.178
with good food and good clothes,
but what is this? [sobbing]

255
00:13:25.804 --> 00:13:27.806
My sister, Ok-dan…

256
00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.391
[sobbing continues]

257
00:13:43.239 --> 00:13:45.074
[Gong-gil] If I continue to watch you,

258
00:13:45.616 --> 00:13:47.326
I shall find out soon enough.

259
00:13:47.993 --> 00:13:50.287
For I have finally found the owner

260
00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.542
of this binyeo that my sister clung to
even after death.

261
00:13:56.627 --> 00:13:57.670
[Mok-ju] Speak plainly.

262
00:13:57.753 --> 00:14:01.632
During the competition, are you absolutely
sure that Gong-gil did not see you?

263
00:14:01.715 --> 00:14:04.510
Yes, Your Grace.
There's no need for concern.

264
00:14:04.593 --> 00:14:06.720
Could it truly be that the lowly jester

265
00:14:06.804 --> 00:14:09.306
is suddenly harboring some feelings
for the gwinyeo?

266
00:14:10.099 --> 00:14:11.850
[laughs]

267
00:14:12.643 --> 00:14:14.228
How amusing is that?

268
00:14:14.853 --> 00:14:16.105
If you are right about that,

269
00:14:16.188 --> 00:14:19.108
and the jester is secretly
harboring feelings for her,

270
00:14:19.191 --> 00:14:21.026
then he will be a constant hindrance.

271
00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:24.989
Have someone trustworthy go find out more
about this Gong-gil fellow.

272
00:14:25.072 --> 00:14:28.617
I must know why he's suddenly involved
in the gwinyeo's affairs.

273
00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:29.702
Yes, Your Grace.

274
00:14:29.785 --> 00:14:31.245
Oh, and after that,

275
00:14:31.328 --> 00:14:34.415
I need you to inform the chief eunuch
I would like to make a request

276
00:14:34.498 --> 00:14:37.334
after the morning assembly
to have an audience with His Majesty.

277
00:14:37.418 --> 00:14:40.296
It shall be done.
I will send word, Your Grace.

278
00:14:40.379 --> 00:14:41.505
[chuckles]

279
00:14:43.507 --> 00:14:44.508
[Song-jae] Your Majesty,

280
00:14:44.592 --> 00:14:46.969
all of these matters are concerning
the ministers.

281
00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:49.054
What are all these petitions for?

282
00:14:49.138 --> 00:14:51.765
They are requesting to decrease
the amount of ginseng

283
00:14:51.849 --> 00:14:54.101
that the Hwanghae Governor
submits as taxes.

284
00:14:54.184 --> 00:14:56.395
They want the amount of ginseng
to go down?

285
00:14:56.478 --> 00:14:59.857
They claim they are suffering from a
shortage of ginseng to submit as taxes

286
00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.859
due to increased smuggling in Kaesong.

287
00:15:01.942 --> 00:15:05.529
However, the envoy, who will be arriving
from Ming in four days,

288
00:15:05.613 --> 00:15:07.740
is said to also be interested
in discussing this issue.

289
00:15:07.823 --> 00:15:08.824
Pardon?

290
00:15:08.908 --> 00:15:12.077
Not only are they buying out
Joseon's ginseng illegally,

291
00:15:12.161 --> 00:15:15.289
now they want to turn it
into a diplomatic issue? [scoffs]

292
00:15:15.372 --> 00:15:17.791
Does Ming intend to take
all of Joseon's ginseng?

293
00:15:18.292 --> 00:15:19.960
It is not for certain yet, Your Majesty.

294
00:15:20.044 --> 00:15:21.420
Please remain calm.

295
00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:22.963
[sighs]

296
00:15:23.547 --> 00:15:25.007
So then,

297
00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.926
who is the chief envoy this time?

298
00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:30.054
He is one of the eight directors who have
gained the emperor's support and trust.

299
00:15:30.137 --> 00:15:31.513
The Imperial Palace Eight.

300
00:15:31.597 --> 00:15:33.140
THE IMPERIAL EIGHT: EIGHT EUNUCHS
FAVORED BY THE MING EMPEROR

301
00:15:33.223 --> 00:15:34.600
Yu Kun, their leader.

302
00:15:37.269 --> 00:15:38.395
Yu Kun?

303
00:15:38.479 --> 00:15:40.773
The envoy that returned to Ming
two years ago

304
00:15:40.856 --> 00:15:43.150
agreed to stop accepting women as tribute.

305
00:15:43.233 --> 00:15:45.402
Was it not that eunuch who called
for the envoy to be punished?

306
00:15:45.486 --> 00:15:46.487
Your Majesty is correct.

307
00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.530
What on earth is he plotting now?

308
00:15:49.573 --> 00:15:53.369
Why is someone like him
coming personally as the chief envoy?

309
00:15:53.452 --> 00:15:55.913
I want you to find out
about his true intentions.

310
00:15:55.996 --> 00:15:57.039
Yes, Your Majesty.

311
00:15:57.122 --> 00:16:00.626
I will send a message to the reception
official and find out in detail for you.

312
00:16:00.709 --> 00:16:01.794
[sighs]

313
00:16:08.717 --> 00:16:10.636
Excuse me, Your Majesty.

314
00:16:10.719 --> 00:16:11.720
Last night,

315
00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.723
when you were having your meal,

316
00:16:16.308 --> 00:16:17.559
the chief royal…

317
00:16:19.436 --> 00:16:21.397
-Forgive me, Your Majesty.
-That's enough suspense.

318
00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.648
Hurry up and say it.

319
00:16:25.401 --> 00:16:26.652
[clears throat]

320
00:16:28.654 --> 00:16:30.698
Whilst enjoying your meal last night,

321
00:16:31.573 --> 00:16:33.033
with the chief royal cook, you…

322
00:16:34.576 --> 00:16:35.577
[kisses]

323
00:16:39.081 --> 00:16:41.959
…did such things.
I am wondering if it's true.

324
00:16:43.711 --> 00:16:45.462
P-Pardon?

325
00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:48.090
I do apologize. Shall we head out now?

326
00:16:48.173 --> 00:16:49.883
Uh, wait a moment!

327
00:16:49.967 --> 00:16:50.968
[Song-jae] Uh…

328
00:16:51.051 --> 00:16:52.553
Come over here.

329
00:16:59.893 --> 00:17:01.478
I had a few drinks is all.

330
00:17:02.604 --> 00:17:05.482
My actions have granted grace
upon an audacious woman,

331
00:17:05.566 --> 00:17:07.985
but instead of being grateful,
a harsh frost

332
00:17:08.068 --> 00:17:10.154
has covered an already unattractive face.

333
00:17:11.155 --> 00:17:12.990
It is a spectacle to witness. Truly.

334
00:17:13.073 --> 00:17:14.074
[chuckles]

335
00:17:14.867 --> 00:17:16.201
Why are you laughing right now?

336
00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.038
You see,

337
00:17:19.121 --> 00:17:22.624
it is known far and wide that women
are weak to gifts, Your Majesty.

338
00:17:22.708 --> 00:17:23.709
You are positive?

339
00:17:23.792 --> 00:17:27.129
Is it not enough that I bestowed grace?
Now I have to buy her a gift too?

340
00:17:27.212 --> 00:17:29.256
When a harsh face grows harsher,

341
00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:32.926
would Your Majesty not find it difficult
to keep looking at?

342
00:17:33.719 --> 00:17:35.220
That is true.

343
00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:37.514
Well, then,

344
00:17:37.598 --> 00:17:40.517
what gift do you think would end up
appeasing such a woman?

345
00:17:41.852 --> 00:17:43.270
-My guess is silk?
-Tsk, tsk, tsk.

346
00:17:43.353 --> 00:17:45.939
A binyeo? Or what about… a ring?

347
00:17:46.023 --> 00:17:47.608
No, Your Majesty.

348
00:17:47.691 --> 00:17:51.445
Listen, it is known that you must never
give just any sort of gift to a woman.

349
00:17:51.528 --> 00:17:53.822
-Oh, then I must…
-What does she like?

350
00:17:53.906 --> 00:17:56.617
The key is to find out what that is
and present that.

351
00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.787
Well, I have no clue what she likes.
How am I supposed to know?

352
00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:01.038
Truly.

353
00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:04.208
That is why women
are difficult to understand.

354
00:18:04.792 --> 00:18:07.127
Her Royal Highness may prefer books
over jewelry on one hand,

355
00:18:07.211 --> 00:18:10.005
while you may know that Her Grace
prefers jewelry over books.

356
00:18:10.089 --> 00:18:14.384
And even though they are both women,
what they like is completely different.

357
00:18:14.468 --> 00:18:18.055
Therefore, I believe you should give it
some deep thought, Your Majesty.

358
00:18:22.351 --> 00:18:23.560
[Min-seong] Your Majesty.

359
00:18:23.644 --> 00:18:26.021
The envoy from the Ming
with the emperor's edict

360
00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:28.273
will be arriving in Hanyang in four days.

361
00:18:28.357 --> 00:18:29.358
I have heard.

362
00:18:30.025 --> 00:18:31.401
Are we ready for the arrival?

363
00:18:31.485 --> 00:18:35.155
The office of the second
minister of rites, Lord Yoo Hyeong-min,

364
00:18:35.239 --> 00:18:37.241
has been appointed as reception official

365
00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:39.201
and is on his way with the escort,
Your Majesty.

366
00:18:39.284 --> 00:18:41.036
[Mun-jeong] The main road from Namdaemun
to Taepyeonggwan

367
00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:43.789
has been ordered to be cleaned
for the delegation, Your Majesty.

368
00:18:43.872 --> 00:18:48.252
In addition, we have already organized
a grand welcoming ceremony with jesters

369
00:18:48.335 --> 00:18:49.753
to entertain the delegation.

370
00:18:49.837 --> 00:18:53.382
Once the official schedule ends,
boats will set sail on the Han River

371
00:18:53.465 --> 00:18:54.633
to hold a poetry reading.

372
00:18:54.716 --> 00:18:56.802
They have been ordered
to thoroughly prepare.

373
00:18:56.885 --> 00:18:58.846
Tell me, what of the bansong preparations?

374
00:18:58.929 --> 00:19:01.140
SENDING THE CHINESE ENVOY OFF
WITH GIFTS WHEN THEY RETURN TO CHINA

375
00:19:01.223 --> 00:19:04.601
As well as having rolls of silk,
there are 200 gwan of silver ingots

376
00:19:04.685 --> 00:19:06.103
that have been prepared for the envoy

377
00:19:06.186 --> 00:19:08.063
-to take back to Ming.
-Pardon me?

378
00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:09.565
200 have been cleared?

379
00:19:09.648 --> 00:19:11.233
[Song-jae] Yes, Your Majesty.
But that's not all.

380
00:19:11.316 --> 00:19:14.319
Just transporting them to the border alone
requires eight people

381
00:19:14.403 --> 00:19:15.571
for every transport cart.

382
00:19:15.654 --> 00:19:17.823
-That's 60 people in total, roughly.
-[scoffs]

383
00:19:17.906 --> 00:19:20.409
Half of the national treasury
will be depleted.

384
00:19:20.492 --> 00:19:21.493
Your Majesty,

385
00:19:22.077 --> 00:19:23.579
this is something we must endure

386
00:19:23.662 --> 00:19:26.165
in order to maintain
a harmonious relationship with Ming.

387
00:19:26.248 --> 00:19:29.334
However, 200 gwan of silver ingots
is excessive, Your Majesty.

388
00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:32.796
Even during the last envoy visit,
it wasn't this excessive, so I must agree.

389
00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:37.259
Have you forgotten? The last envoy
was a civil official in Ming

390
00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:38.927
who was not motivated by money.

391
00:19:39.011 --> 00:19:41.805
However, the director eunuch
coming this time

392
00:19:41.889 --> 00:19:44.850
is notoriously greedy and arrogant
even in Ming.

393
00:19:44.933 --> 00:19:47.019
If we are in excess, we can reduce it,

394
00:19:47.102 --> 00:19:49.438
but if we are lacking,
it could be too late, Your Majesty.

395
00:19:49.521 --> 00:19:52.566
For now,
this is our best course of action.

396
00:19:52.649 --> 00:19:54.735
I share the same sentiments
as Lord Councillor Han.

397
00:19:54.818 --> 00:19:57.696
We do not know what demands
this chief envoy will make,

398
00:19:57.779 --> 00:20:00.574
and we cannot ignore
the influence they currently hold.

399
00:20:00.657 --> 00:20:02.618
We must aim to avoid conflict this visit,

400
00:20:02.701 --> 00:20:04.953
-should we not, Your Majesty?
-Enough!

401
00:20:08.832 --> 00:20:10.375
You've spoken enough.

402
00:20:10.459 --> 00:20:11.752
As you all know,

403
00:20:12.461 --> 00:20:14.213
the blood and sweat of the people

404
00:20:14.796 --> 00:20:16.840
is what built the national treasury.

405
00:20:16.924 --> 00:20:18.008
Yet you all

406
00:20:18.592 --> 00:20:21.428
are eagerly catering to their whims
and minding yourselves

407
00:20:21.511 --> 00:20:24.306
without plans to protect
the national treasury that we have built?

408
00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:28.852
You prepared silk and 200 gwan of ingots
because you are unsure of their demands?

409
00:20:29.561 --> 00:20:30.771
[laughs]

410
00:20:31.772 --> 00:20:36.151
And you stand here today, claiming that
your actions are in the people's interest?

411
00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:39.821
Can you truly say that you are acting
in the interest of our country now?

412
00:20:39.905 --> 00:20:41.323
However, Your Majesty,

413
00:20:41.406 --> 00:20:44.493
diplomatic issues cannot be approached
solely from our own standpoint.

414
00:20:44.576 --> 00:20:49.957
The tax by the blood and sweat of Joseon,
lies solely with the Joseon royal line.

415
00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:53.252
Lessen the number of silk rolls
and silver ingots to be sent to Ming

416
00:20:53.335 --> 00:20:57.756
and prepare the reception for the envoy…
using the least amount.

417
00:20:58.924 --> 00:21:04.179
[all] Yes, Your Majesty.
We will do as you have ordered.

418
00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:11.812
Your Majesty.

419
00:21:13.939 --> 00:21:14.940
All of you, step back.

420
00:21:15.023 --> 00:21:16.817
[all] Yes, Your Majesty.

421
00:21:19.152 --> 00:21:20.153
What do you want?

422
00:21:20.946 --> 00:21:24.616
We found Yi Jang-gyun,
fallen down at Banchon this morning.

423
00:21:25.367 --> 00:21:26.743
Is he still alive?

424
00:21:26.827 --> 00:21:29.621
Yes. He has deep wounds
and appears to be unconscious.

425
00:21:29.705 --> 00:21:30.789
Where is he now?

426
00:21:33.041 --> 00:21:34.126
And the draft?

427
00:21:34.209 --> 00:21:36.128
We were not able to find it.

428
00:21:36.211 --> 00:21:39.381
He was taken to safety
to receive medical treatment, but…

429
00:21:39.464 --> 00:21:40.465
Say it.

430
00:21:40.549 --> 00:21:42.551
There is no trace of him.
He has disappeared.

431
00:21:43.176 --> 00:21:44.344
He just vanished?

432
00:21:44.428 --> 00:21:47.472
Yes. There were no signs of intruders,
Your Majesty,

433
00:21:47.556 --> 00:21:49.599
so it seems that he has left on his own.

434
00:21:49.683 --> 00:21:52.602
Hang on, but in that condition,
where could Yi have hidden himself?

435
00:21:53.603 --> 00:21:58.859
It is clear that there is someone looking
for Yi Jang-gyun, in pursuit of his life.

436
00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:02.988
[Yi Heon] Who on earth is it? Who?

437
00:22:04.364 --> 00:22:07.951
Select a few discreet and swift soldiers
immediately… to find Yi.

438
00:22:08.577 --> 00:22:09.745
Yes, right away.

439
00:22:11.079 --> 00:22:12.289
You have to hurry yourself.

440
00:22:19.087 --> 00:22:23.675
Your Majesty, Her Grace is requesting to
have a brief audience with Your Majesty.

441
00:22:23.759 --> 00:22:25.302
Will you proceed to Jahongwon?

442
00:22:26.511 --> 00:22:31.099
Today… I shall not be bothered by anyone.

443
00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:34.352
Ah, however… [stammers] Your Majesty!

444
00:22:37.230 --> 00:22:39.232
[court lady]
The butterfly hairpin, Your Grace.

445
00:22:39.316 --> 00:22:40.901
Yes, this is quite lovely.

446
00:22:44.654 --> 00:22:46.323
[Chu-wol] Leave the room at once.

447
00:22:53.038 --> 00:22:54.039
What is it?

448
00:22:54.122 --> 00:22:56.541
His Majesty has left
the hall of governance

449
00:22:57.292 --> 00:22:59.169
and immediately headed to his bedchamber.

450
00:22:59.252 --> 00:23:02.339
What's that?
Did my message reach His Majesty?

451
00:23:02.422 --> 00:23:04.382
That I requested an audience with him?

452
00:23:04.466 --> 00:23:06.384
-He had been told.
-[scoffs]

453
00:23:07.469 --> 00:23:10.722
[sighs] Is this truly how he'll treat me
from now on?

454
00:23:17.646 --> 00:23:19.397
Make haste! Drag the queen out!

455
00:23:19.481 --> 00:23:21.733
[Yeon] Let go! Let go of me! [cries]

456
00:23:21.817 --> 00:23:23.902
How dare you? [sobs]

457
00:23:24.694 --> 00:23:26.363
Your Majesty, why are you--

458
00:23:26.446 --> 00:23:29.282
I do not want to hear any more.
Take her away now!

459
00:23:29.366 --> 00:23:31.701
-Let go! I said, let go!
-Get up, Your Royal Highness. Please!

460
00:23:31.785 --> 00:23:34.621
[Yeon] Your Majesty, Your Majesty!
[echoing]

461
00:23:34.704 --> 00:23:37.332
[Yeon] A king is one who fathoms
and understands.

462
00:23:37.415 --> 00:23:43.672
He must consider his family, the heavens,
and understand the hearts of others.

463
00:23:43.755 --> 00:23:45.298
[young Yi Heon] Fathom and understand?

464
00:23:45.924 --> 00:23:49.469
[Yeon] Once you grow up,
you will understand.

465
00:23:53.265 --> 00:23:56.685
Your Majesty, this way leads
straight to the royal kitchen.

466
00:24:10.991 --> 00:24:14.077
Uh, why did I come… here?

467
00:24:14.161 --> 00:24:16.246
Are you going to eat it or not? Ah.

468
00:24:16.329 --> 00:24:18.748
It makes me glad to see you enjoying it.

469
00:24:18.832 --> 00:24:23.336
I figured that… you'd have a lot on your
mind today with everything going on.

470
00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:27.674
Being king must come with its perks, but
also a fair share of challenges as well.

471
00:24:30.802 --> 00:24:35.640
[Yi Heon] My heart is heavy today,
but how is it that you come to mind?

472
00:24:50.989 --> 00:24:52.073
[sighs]

473
00:24:55.035 --> 00:24:58.330
[Su-hyeok] Someone is looking
for Yi Jang-gyun, in pursuit of his life.

474
00:24:58.413 --> 00:25:00.916
[Yi Heon]
Even I have never seen the draft records.

475
00:25:01.541 --> 00:25:07.380
So who on earth is pursuing Yi
this persistently and why? I must know.

476
00:25:07.464 --> 00:25:10.634
Your Majesty… it is I, Court Lady Choi.

477
00:25:10.717 --> 00:25:12.552
-You can enter.
-[door opens]

478
00:25:17.724 --> 00:25:21.102
Your Majesty. For today's royal dinner--

479
00:25:21.186 --> 00:25:23.104
-Not today.
-Yes?

480
00:25:23.188 --> 00:25:25.106
-How about--
-Enough!

481
00:25:26.983 --> 00:25:31.780
Today, I do not wish
for a meal of any kind.

482
00:25:32.656 --> 00:25:33.740
Yes, Your Majesty.

483
00:25:39.204 --> 00:25:40.747
[door opens]

484
00:25:47.879 --> 00:25:52.425
So he is not only skipping his meals
but staying in his bedchamber as well?

485
00:25:53.927 --> 00:25:55.637
Something does not feel right.

486
00:25:56.930 --> 00:26:01.017
Have you heard yet? About how His Majesty
kissed the new chief royal cook

487
00:26:01.101 --> 00:26:02.978
when she served him his meal
at Unyeongjeong last night?

488
00:26:03.061 --> 00:26:04.354
Yes, I have.

489
00:26:04.896 --> 00:26:07.148
However,
that was because His Majesty was drunk--

490
00:26:07.232 --> 00:26:09.401
It couldn't have just
been that he was drunk.

491
00:26:09.484 --> 00:26:11.444
There are always signs
before these things happen.

492
00:26:11.528 --> 00:26:12.862
What do you mean?

493
00:26:12.946 --> 00:26:16.283
The very existence of the chief royal cook
is a thorn I can't get out.

494
00:26:16.366 --> 00:26:18.118
What should we do about it?

495
00:26:18.201 --> 00:26:19.869
If he refuses to see me,

496
00:26:21.079 --> 00:26:23.123
then I have no choice but to pay a visit.

497
00:26:24.165 --> 00:26:25.750
Do I remember correctly
that the jinhu is soon?

498
00:26:25.834 --> 00:26:27.085
CEREMONY OF CHECKING
THE KING'S HEALTH

499
00:26:27.168 --> 00:26:30.422
Yes, Grand Prince Jesan will be
coming to the palace in two days' time.

500
00:26:30.505 --> 00:26:31.631
Lovely.

501
00:26:32.257 --> 00:26:36.011
I have a wonderful idea. How about I serve
His Majesty his food that day?

502
00:26:36.094 --> 00:26:37.887
An excellent plan, Your Grace.

503
00:26:37.971 --> 00:26:39.931
So you can win His Majesty's favor back.

504
00:26:40.015 --> 00:26:41.182
[chuckles]

505
00:26:41.266 --> 00:26:43.727
And what would be a good dish to serve?

506
00:26:45.186 --> 00:26:48.231
His Majesty has decided
to skip today's dinner.

507
00:26:48.315 --> 00:26:49.316
Okay.

508
00:26:49.399 --> 00:26:53.778
-What? He doesn't want dinner? W-Why?
-I am not sure to be honest.

509
00:26:53.862 --> 00:26:57.198
But he has ordered that no meals
are to be served today.

510
00:26:57.282 --> 00:26:59.784
It's rather strange, though,
to give that order.

511
00:26:59.868 --> 00:27:01.077
[Chun-sik] Strange indeed!

512
00:27:01.161 --> 00:27:05.373
It is quite unusual for him
to ever skip a meal, so I am worried.

513
00:27:05.457 --> 00:27:07.417
Well, I'll get started on making dinner.

514
00:27:07.500 --> 00:27:09.294
If he won't eat it,
then there's nothing we can do.

515
00:27:09.377 --> 00:27:10.420
Please say you have an idea.

516
00:27:10.503 --> 00:27:12.297
We'll definitely try our best.
Don't worry.

517
00:27:12.380 --> 00:27:15.592
Yes, brilliant. You are doing good work.
[sighs]

518
00:27:15.675 --> 00:27:17.302
[all] Take care, sir.

519
00:27:18.762 --> 00:27:20.847
-[Bong-sik] My goodness, this is really…
-Let's go.

520
00:27:21.639 --> 00:27:23.475
-What?
-Le… Hmm?

521
00:27:23.558 --> 00:27:25.018
[Gil-geum] Le-Le… Lego!

522
00:27:30.315 --> 00:27:33.068
[Maeng] We could have removed the chief
royal cook through that competition.

523
00:27:33.151 --> 00:27:35.403
I have no excuse for my failure.

524
00:27:35.487 --> 00:27:38.406
I am giving you one last opportunity
to become the chief royal cook.

525
00:27:38.490 --> 00:27:39.491
Your Grace…

526
00:27:40.200 --> 00:27:41.493
-this is?
-Bisang.

527
00:27:41.576 --> 00:27:43.578
POISON/ARSENIC USED
FOR EXECUTIONS OR ASSASSINATIONS

528
00:27:43.661 --> 00:27:47.582
Watch for the right time and mix that into
the royal meal the gwinyeo prepares.

529
00:27:48.958 --> 00:27:50.293
[sighs]

530
00:27:54.130 --> 00:27:56.341
ROYAL DINNER

531
00:27:57.467 --> 00:27:59.260
Mmm.

532
00:27:59.344 --> 00:28:00.887
CHICKEN FRICASSEE
A FRENCH CREAM STEW WITH CHICKEN

533
00:28:02.055 --> 00:28:03.056
What?

534
00:28:05.850 --> 00:28:07.394
EARLY BREAKFAST

535
00:28:08.311 --> 00:28:10.980
[Mal-im] Your Majesty,
your early breakfast is served.

536
00:28:14.234 --> 00:28:15.318
Gosh.

537
00:28:15.402 --> 00:28:17.570
[Ji-young] He really should try this one.

538
00:28:20.698 --> 00:28:22.659
LUNCH

539
00:28:23.243 --> 00:28:26.079
[Mal-im]
Your Majesty, your lunch is served.

540
00:28:28.623 --> 00:28:30.708
-[sighs]
-[Ji-young sighs]

541
00:28:30.792 --> 00:28:32.502
[exhales]

542
00:28:32.585 --> 00:28:34.921
ROYAL DINNER

543
00:28:41.469 --> 00:28:42.929
[sighs]

544
00:28:43.012 --> 00:28:46.141
[yawning] It's exhausting. So exhausting.

545
00:28:47.183 --> 00:28:48.977
Goodness,
you've worked so hard today, miss.

546
00:28:49.060 --> 00:28:50.603
You worked really hard too, Gil-geum.

547
00:28:53.398 --> 00:28:54.607
[Ji-young sighs]

548
00:28:54.691 --> 00:28:57.360
Oh, my.
Wait, you're not going inside to sleep?

549
00:28:57.444 --> 00:28:59.362
Mmm, you go ahead.

550
00:28:59.446 --> 00:29:01.781
All right. But hurry up and come in soon.

551
00:29:01.865 --> 00:29:03.116
[Ji-young] I will.

552
00:29:05.869 --> 00:29:07.162
[sighs]

553
00:29:09.581 --> 00:29:10.790
[chuckles]

554
00:29:10.874 --> 00:29:13.293
How did I end up here, of all places?

555
00:29:14.085 --> 00:29:17.005
Winning La Poêle d'Or
feels like it was only yesterday.

556
00:29:17.088 --> 00:29:19.674
[chuckles] Now it feels like a past life.

557
00:29:20.759 --> 00:29:22.051
[chuckles]

558
00:29:24.387 --> 00:29:25.388
[sighs]

559
00:29:26.431 --> 00:29:28.933
I can't help but wonder how Dad's doing.

560
00:29:30.560 --> 00:29:31.936
I really miss him.

561
00:29:33.271 --> 00:29:34.773
[sniffles]

562
00:29:34.856 --> 00:29:38.151
He better not be skipping meals
like His Majesty is doing.

563
00:29:42.781 --> 00:29:44.073
[sighs]

564
00:29:52.874 --> 00:29:54.000
[gasps]

565
00:29:54.083 --> 00:29:56.544
Oh, my. You've gone insane.
This is crazy. Crazy!

566
00:29:57.378 --> 00:29:58.379
[gasps]

567
00:30:01.591 --> 00:30:04.761
Whoa. What did I imagine right now? Huh?

568
00:30:05.678 --> 00:30:07.931
Anyway, is this guy not even
a little hungry?

569
00:30:08.932 --> 00:30:12.685
Everybody needs to eat,
so why on earth is he acting this way?

570
00:30:13.520 --> 00:30:14.687
Seriously, though.

571
00:30:16.397 --> 00:30:17.398
[sighs]

572
00:30:17.482 --> 00:30:19.234
[owl hoots]

573
00:30:23.863 --> 00:30:27.742
Our little princess, is this little bite
good enough for you? Say, "Ah."

574
00:30:27.826 --> 00:30:30.203
This is called "tableside service."

575
00:30:30.286 --> 00:30:33.790
It's so that you can watch your food
being prepared and ignite your hunger.

576
00:30:33.873 --> 00:30:37.293
Here, watch me. "Ah."

577
00:30:39.462 --> 00:30:41.047
[stomach gurgling]

578
00:30:44.717 --> 00:30:47.345
Am I thinking of you because I'm hungry?

579
00:30:48.471 --> 00:30:51.266
Or is it that I am hungry
because I am thinking of you?

580
00:30:55.979 --> 00:30:57.063
I cannot tell.

581
00:31:01.401 --> 00:31:02.694
Chang-seon.

582
00:31:05.989 --> 00:31:07.365
Yes, Your Majesty.

583
00:31:08.074 --> 00:31:09.492
When will dinner be served?

584
00:31:10.159 --> 00:31:11.744
Huh?

585
00:31:11.828 --> 00:31:15.248
Did you ask me
when dinner tonight will be served?

586
00:31:15.331 --> 00:31:16.541
Yes.

587
00:31:16.624 --> 00:31:17.792
[Chang-seon] Oh…

588
00:31:17.876 --> 00:31:20.211
I have grown quite hungry.

589
00:31:20.295 --> 00:31:22.338
[Chang-seon chuckles]

590
00:31:25.633 --> 00:31:28.928
[Mal-im]
Your Majesty, the royal dinner is served.

591
00:31:29.012 --> 00:31:30.346
[Yi Heon] Bring it in.

592
00:31:43.026 --> 00:31:44.235
[door closes]

593
00:31:47.614 --> 00:31:48.907
[Mal-im clears throat]

594
00:31:54.787 --> 00:31:57.290
It has been a while now, Chief Royal Cook.

595
00:31:58.041 --> 00:32:01.461
Yes, it's been a while, Your Majesty.
Too long.

596
00:32:01.544 --> 00:32:04.631
So, what is for dinner tonight then?

597
00:32:06.049 --> 00:32:08.051
I made chicken soup
to soothe your stomach.

598
00:32:08.134 --> 00:32:10.720
Considering you haven't eaten
a meal all day, Your Majesty.

599
00:32:13.806 --> 00:32:17.560
A CLEAR CHICKEN BROTH
WITH MEAT AND VEGETABLES

600
00:32:17.644 --> 00:32:19.270
What did you put in it?

601
00:32:19.354 --> 00:32:22.732
It's been simmering with a few vegetables
as well as whole pieces of chicken.

602
00:32:22.815 --> 00:32:24.734
I thought you could use "simple"
and "comforting."

603
00:32:24.817 --> 00:32:27.445
-Hmm.
-Just in case it might upset your stomach,

604
00:32:27.528 --> 00:32:31.324
I also wanted to give you dongchimi
as an easily-digestible side dish.

605
00:32:31.407 --> 00:32:32.575
[chuckles]

606
00:32:34.160 --> 00:32:35.203
You will be tasting it.

607
00:32:35.286 --> 00:32:36.704
Yes, Your Majesty.

608
00:32:46.089 --> 00:32:47.382
Mmm…

609
00:32:48.299 --> 00:32:49.342
Mmm…

610
00:33:02.689 --> 00:33:03.815
[sighs]

611
00:33:07.026 --> 00:33:09.570
[chuckles]

612
00:33:12.156 --> 00:33:13.825
It is truly delicious.

613
00:33:16.619 --> 00:33:18.246
[Yi Heon grunts]

614
00:33:18.329 --> 00:33:20.289
[romantic ballad playing]

615
00:33:29.048 --> 00:33:30.091
Ah…

616
00:33:35.388 --> 00:33:36.514
[sighs]

617
00:33:37.348 --> 00:33:38.683
[Yi Heon chuckles]

618
00:33:50.528 --> 00:33:55.158
Hmm? What am I feeling? Why am I so proud?

619
00:33:55.241 --> 00:33:56.409
[chuckles]

620
00:33:58.161 --> 00:33:59.829
[song continues]

621
00:34:11.340 --> 00:34:12.550
[chuckles]

622
00:34:16.304 --> 00:34:17.722
[heartbeat thumping]

623
00:34:17.805 --> 00:34:19.432
[Yi Heon] When I look at you…

624
00:34:20.933 --> 00:34:25.063
why does my heart…
pound so heavily like so?

625
00:34:28.316 --> 00:34:30.109
[song ends]

626
00:34:30.193 --> 00:34:31.736
GRAND PRINCE JESAN'S RESIDENCE

627
00:34:31.819 --> 00:34:37.075
Was it not recently, the anniversary
of your brother Kim I-son's death?

628
00:34:37.158 --> 00:34:41.370
Indeed, my lord.
His tragic passing was… too sudden for us.

629
00:34:41.454 --> 00:34:45.625
He did pass away so suddenly
during the Muin Purge,

630
00:34:46.125 --> 00:34:50.338
along with the brothers
and the friends of the other lords.

631
00:34:51.339 --> 00:34:55.551
That is why we have gathered like this,
is it not?

632
00:34:56.552 --> 00:34:57.678
Yes.

633
00:34:58.679 --> 00:34:59.889
Then tell me why…

634
00:35:01.307 --> 00:35:05.186
you sent an assassin without my
permission into the Salgoji Forest.

635
00:35:05.895 --> 00:35:09.232
With your entire family almost wiped out
during the terrible purge…

636
00:35:10.775 --> 00:35:13.945
I have no doubt that after you survived
on your own, you felt ashamed of it.

637
00:35:14.028 --> 00:35:16.155
After all, you were His Majesty's teacher.

638
00:35:16.239 --> 00:35:21.661
Even so, did you think it acceptable to
go off on your own and act out like this?

639
00:35:25.039 --> 00:35:29.961
I thought that there would be no better
opportunity than that very instance.

640
00:35:32.380 --> 00:35:34.674
I sincerely apologize, Your Highness.

641
00:35:34.757 --> 00:35:37.969
You are the reason that His Majesty
doesn't have a calm heart any longer.

642
00:35:38.052 --> 00:35:40.304
The day you are discovered,
we will all pay…

643
00:35:42.223 --> 00:35:43.516
for what you have done.

644
00:35:48.855 --> 00:35:50.731
[Yang-son]
The land deed for the Yeoju area.

645
00:35:50.815 --> 00:35:52.984
With this, you and your family
can now live comfortably

646
00:35:53.067 --> 00:35:54.610
for the rest of your lives.

647
00:35:56.362 --> 00:35:59.323
Grand Prince Jesan knows
that I was the one who orchestrated

648
00:35:59.407 --> 00:36:01.784
sending an assassin
into the Salgoji Forest.

649
00:36:03.077 --> 00:36:06.956
Henceforth,
you live as if you were already dead.

650
00:36:22.513 --> 00:36:24.807
[grunting]

651
00:36:35.109 --> 00:36:36.819
[grunting continues]

652
00:36:45.411 --> 00:36:46.537
[Deok-chul] Capture him!

653
00:36:56.297 --> 00:36:57.506
[grunts]

654
00:36:59.675 --> 00:37:01.761
[breathing heavily]

655
00:37:04.305 --> 00:37:07.141
So Grand Prince Jesan is the reason
for Kim Yang-son?

656
00:37:08.184 --> 00:37:09.977
[scoffs] Interesting.

657
00:37:10.895 --> 00:37:14.649
[sighs] It reeks of a foul stench.

658
00:37:21.155 --> 00:37:23.032
So you're saying you lost him again?

659
00:37:24.200 --> 00:37:26.869
I deeply apologize, Your Highness.

660
00:37:26.953 --> 00:37:31.165
He is no ordinary man.
A rat-like scoundrel.

661
00:37:31.249 --> 00:37:34.877
I will capture him
and eliminate any future threats.

662
00:37:54.730 --> 00:37:57.608
You have already let him slip away once.

663
00:37:59.151 --> 00:38:01.612
And now you will never find him again.

664
00:38:01.696 --> 00:38:02.697
[Deok-chul] My lord!

665
00:38:02.780 --> 00:38:06.158
He is the one who attempted to assassinate
the king. He will surely reveal himself!

666
00:38:06.242 --> 00:38:08.202
-[screams]
-[cowers]

667
00:38:09.495 --> 00:38:12.373
[breathing shakily]

668
00:38:14.000 --> 00:38:18.879
If you ever fail me again,
next time I promise it will be your head.

669
00:38:20.506 --> 00:38:21.632
Understood, my lord!

670
00:38:26.387 --> 00:38:27.388
JAHONGWON

671
00:38:27.471 --> 00:38:29.932
[Mok-ju] His Majesty has begun to eat
the chief royal cook's meals again

672
00:38:30.016 --> 00:38:31.392
since last night?

673
00:38:31.475 --> 00:38:35.021
Yes, Your Grace. I heard it directly from
a court lady at His Majesty's quarters.

674
00:38:35.104 --> 00:38:37.982
Chu-wol, go to the royal kitchen
with this message at once.

675
00:38:38.065 --> 00:38:41.485
Because today, I, Consort Kang,
for His Majesty, the connoisseur,

676
00:38:41.569 --> 00:38:43.946
will take care of the lunch preparations
for the jinhu.

677
00:38:44.030 --> 00:38:45.489
I'll send the message.

678
00:38:46.490 --> 00:38:48.492
And deliver this separately to Cook Maeng.

679
00:38:49.452 --> 00:38:50.703
Yes, Your Grace.

680
00:38:52.163 --> 00:38:54.749
I will not let this get in my way
any longer.

681
00:38:54.832 --> 00:38:59.587
I will be teaching a lesson personally
to the chief royal cook.

682
00:38:59.670 --> 00:39:03.799
You will always burn yourself,
whenever you fly too close to the sun.

683
00:39:06.510 --> 00:39:08.179
[Chun-sik] Here, here, here, here.

684
00:39:08.262 --> 00:39:10.890
-[Bong-sik] Oh, my, sir.
-Yes, hello, hello.

685
00:39:10.973 --> 00:39:13.476
-Oh, my. Oh, my. Here we are.
-The cut you wanted.

686
00:39:13.559 --> 00:39:15.686
-Oh, wow, thank you.
-This beef is a very good cut

687
00:39:15.770 --> 00:39:17.938
-from Banchon.
-[Ji-young] Whoa…

688
00:39:18.022 --> 00:39:20.566
[Gil-geum] Oh, my.
Look at this beautiful meat.

689
00:39:20.649 --> 00:39:23.611
It must have been freshly butchered,
judging by the marbling on it.

690
00:39:23.694 --> 00:39:25.237
It also has a nice sheen.

691
00:39:25.321 --> 00:39:27.823
-Wow, this is as fresh as it gets.
-Wow.

692
00:39:28.699 --> 00:39:30.201
Oh, miss, you're right.

693
00:39:30.284 --> 00:39:33.579
It has that distinct, rich aroma
that you get with very fresh meat.

694
00:39:33.662 --> 00:39:34.663
[chuckles]

695
00:39:34.747 --> 00:39:38.125
There is already meat at the Saongwon.
Why did you go all the way to Banchon?

696
00:39:38.209 --> 00:39:40.836
Because His Majesty
will have the jinhu today,

697
00:39:40.920 --> 00:39:43.464
so Grand Prince Jesan
will be at the palace.

698
00:39:43.547 --> 00:39:46.008
If you could, please make a unique,
royal meal with this.

699
00:39:46.092 --> 00:39:47.218
[chuckles]

700
00:39:47.301 --> 00:39:50.679
I will. Um, but what is jinhu,
um, exactly?

701
00:39:50.763 --> 00:39:54.183
It's when the Grand Prince Jesan
will have an audience with His Majesty

702
00:39:54.266 --> 00:39:56.727
and will examine the health of His Majesty

703
00:39:56.811 --> 00:39:58.521
with the royal doctor present as well.

704
00:39:58.604 --> 00:40:00.773
Ah, a health check-up, really.

705
00:40:00.856 --> 00:40:02.608
He-health check-up?

706
00:40:03.359 --> 00:40:05.444
Well, yes, you could say that, I suppose.
[chuckles]

707
00:40:05.528 --> 00:40:10.157
Um, so will His Majesty and Grand Prince
Jesan dine together today for this thing?

708
00:40:10.241 --> 00:40:11.742
That is right. You should start,

709
00:40:11.826 --> 00:40:14.245
and prepare so it's ready for them
after the jinhu.

710
00:40:14.328 --> 00:40:15.955
-Yes, sir. Understood.
-[chuckles]

711
00:40:16.038 --> 00:40:17.832
[Gil-geum] Please take care, sir!

712
00:40:17.915 --> 00:40:19.458
[cooks] Take care.

713
00:40:21.001 --> 00:40:24.338
So, uh, who exactly is Grand Prince Jesan?

714
00:40:24.422 --> 00:40:27.466
He is family of the late king,
his cousin actually.

715
00:40:27.550 --> 00:40:29.343
The late king is His Majesty's father.

716
00:40:29.427 --> 00:40:32.721
Ah, so he's another royal. [chuckles]

717
00:40:32.805 --> 00:40:35.808
Wait a second. Grand Prince Jesan?

718
00:40:35.891 --> 00:40:39.145
Wasn't it Grand Prince Jinmyeong
who became king through the coup?

719
00:40:39.812 --> 00:40:41.939
[sighs] This is really confusing.

720
00:40:42.731 --> 00:40:47.236
Okay. Since a special person
is coming today, the menu… [grunts]

721
00:40:47.903 --> 00:40:50.489
I believe we should have
a meeting about the food? Hmm?

722
00:40:50.573 --> 00:40:52.658
-Food meeting.
-[cooks murmuring]

723
00:40:52.741 --> 00:40:55.744
[Gil-geum] Come on. Don't just stand
there. Let's gather together, all right?

724
00:40:55.828 --> 00:40:57.621
[Bong-sik sighs] A meat-ing?

725
00:40:59.623 --> 00:41:00.749
Here we go.

726
00:41:01.500 --> 00:41:02.960
[Chu-wol] Cook Maeng. A word.

727
00:41:05.004 --> 00:41:06.130
[Maeng] Ah!

728
00:41:06.797 --> 00:41:08.966
Yes? What is it you need?

729
00:41:10.676 --> 00:41:13.554
For today's lunch, Her Grace
will personally prepare the meal.

730
00:41:14.221 --> 00:41:16.682
Therefore, you must prepare these dishes.

731
00:41:16.765 --> 00:41:20.227
She will prepare lunch?
We have a chief royal cook. How could--

732
00:41:20.311 --> 00:41:21.395
Do not argue about it!

733
00:41:21.479 --> 00:41:23.022
Yes, I apologize.

734
00:41:32.364 --> 00:41:34.450
BAEKMAJATANG,
HWANGJAGYE HONDONTANG

735
00:41:36.952 --> 00:41:38.704
Hen meat only?

736
00:41:39.830 --> 00:41:42.500
Hmm. Can you make this
side a little bit rounder?

737
00:41:42.583 --> 00:41:44.668
-Yes. Like this much?
-Mm-hmm.

738
00:41:44.752 --> 00:41:47.171
-[Gil-geum] Mmm… Okay.
-[Ji-young] I think we're done.

739
00:41:47.838 --> 00:41:50.132
So, since today is important,

740
00:41:50.216 --> 00:41:52.801
I thought we could make a very special
kind of meal for our guest of honor.

741
00:41:52.885 --> 00:41:54.303
[Gil-geum clears throat]

742
00:41:54.386 --> 00:41:57.056
-Cook Maeng isn't here though?
-Ah… Well, he…

743
00:41:58.140 --> 00:41:59.141
I am here.

744
00:42:01.101 --> 00:42:05.564
Uh, it's just… I just heard that Her Grace
will be personally serving today's lunch.

745
00:42:06.232 --> 00:42:08.192
What? And who told you that?

746
00:42:08.275 --> 00:42:09.568
She gave me instructions

747
00:42:09.652 --> 00:42:12.238
for what the lunch for His Highness
and His Majesty should include

748
00:42:12.321 --> 00:42:13.697
and what to prepare.

749
00:42:13.781 --> 00:42:15.950
[Bong-sik clears throat] Is… is that so?

750
00:42:16.033 --> 00:42:19.036
Oh, dear, this is… [clears throat]

751
00:42:19.119 --> 00:42:22.206
Well, then, is the royal meal
in your hands for the lunch today?

752
00:42:22.289 --> 00:42:24.667
Yes. Embarrassingly, yes.

753
00:42:24.750 --> 00:42:29.213
Hey, why would you feel that way, huh?
What power do we have but to obey?

754
00:42:30.756 --> 00:42:33.884
Please, Cook Maeng, you should prepare
what Her Grace has instructed you to.

755
00:42:33.968 --> 00:42:36.887
But since His Majesty
didn't give new orders,

756
00:42:36.971 --> 00:42:39.473
I will proceed with the lunch
I was originally going to make.

757
00:42:39.557 --> 00:42:41.267
[Gil-geum] Y-yes. I mean, she's right.

758
00:42:41.350 --> 00:42:44.061
What if we don't make His Majesty
anything and then he goes,

759
00:42:44.144 --> 00:42:47.189
"I never ordered such a horrible thing"?

760
00:42:47.273 --> 00:42:50.276
Then all of us here will lose our heads
one by one.

761
00:42:50.901 --> 00:42:52.278
[Maeng] Understood.

762
00:42:52.361 --> 00:42:55.239
Cook Min, you will come and help me out.

763
00:42:55.322 --> 00:42:56.991
Uh, yeah, I will do that.

764
00:43:00.869 --> 00:43:02.037
[Bong-sik clicks tongue, sighs]

765
00:43:02.121 --> 00:43:05.749
Now, shall I begin explaining it all?
Gil-geum?

766
00:43:05.833 --> 00:43:06.917
Yes.

767
00:43:09.295 --> 00:43:11.255
For today's dish, we have…

768
00:43:12.631 --> 00:43:13.632
schnitzel!

769
00:43:14.425 --> 00:43:15.843
[cooks stammering]

770
00:43:15.926 --> 00:43:17.261
Scho-nit…

771
00:43:18.137 --> 00:43:19.221
It's pork cutlet.

772
00:43:19.305 --> 00:43:22.182
It's that kinda meal that makes
every single Korean, young or old,

773
00:43:22.266 --> 00:43:23.517
go totally crazy.

774
00:43:23.601 --> 00:43:24.768
"Cutlet"?

775
00:43:24.852 --> 00:43:27.021
[Gil-geum] I've never heard of it.
[chuckles]

776
00:43:29.064 --> 00:43:30.983
Pound it thin and then spread it like so,

777
00:43:31.066 --> 00:43:33.152
-and don't forget the connective tissues.
-All right.

778
00:43:33.235 --> 00:43:35.529
Yes. That's it. That's great. Good.

779
00:43:35.613 --> 00:43:36.864
About this much.

780
00:43:36.947 --> 00:43:39.074
-And then cut it in fours.
-[Bong-sik] Ah…

781
00:43:39.992 --> 00:43:41.201
Good.

782
00:43:42.369 --> 00:43:44.246
My goodness,
this is harder than I thought.

783
00:43:44.330 --> 00:43:46.582
[uplifting music playing]

784
00:44:00.304 --> 00:44:02.056
[Ji-young]
Now we take the beef that has been pounded

785
00:44:02.139 --> 00:44:03.932
and season it with salt and pepper.

786
00:44:04.016 --> 00:44:08.479
Next we coat it with flour,
and we dip it in the egg wash.

787
00:44:08.562 --> 00:44:11.148
We will make a nice batter of fried flour
crumbs and coat the meat with it

788
00:44:11.231 --> 00:44:14.652
since we don't have breadcrumbs.
Press firmly so it doesn't fall off.

789
00:44:14.735 --> 00:44:16.111
Like that.

790
00:44:16.195 --> 00:44:18.572
And once you put it in the oil, game over.

791
00:44:22.701 --> 00:44:25.704
And this is what we call schnitzel,
my friends.

792
00:44:25.788 --> 00:44:26.914
Schu-nitzel.

793
00:44:26.997 --> 00:44:28.082
"Shenny…"

794
00:44:28.165 --> 00:44:29.166
"Shu…"

795
00:44:31.168 --> 00:44:34.338
[Ji-young] We'll also fry
some burdock root to serve on the side

796
00:44:34.421 --> 00:44:36.840
and make a sauce with raspberry jam.

797
00:44:53.232 --> 00:44:54.274
[Bong-sik] Whoa.

798
00:44:54.358 --> 00:44:55.692
There's a saying that goes,

799
00:44:56.235 --> 00:44:59.029
"Even a pair of shoes can taste good
if you just fry it."

800
00:44:59.113 --> 00:45:01.615
-[muttering]
-Wow. [chuckles]

801
00:45:01.698 --> 00:45:04.952
-This is impressive, look at it. Uh… good!
-Ooh!

802
00:45:05.035 --> 00:45:07.496
[Ji-young]
It's still not quite done yet. Hang on.

803
00:45:08.247 --> 00:45:10.124
-You cut it up before eating.
-[Bong-sik stammering]

804
00:45:10.207 --> 00:45:12.751
A-Are you putting a knife
to serve with the royal meal?

805
00:45:12.835 --> 00:45:15.671
Even the tiniest of knives,
if you serve a royal meal with one,

806
00:45:15.754 --> 00:45:16.755
we'll get in trouble

807
00:45:16.839 --> 00:45:19.049
-and we will all lose our heads.
-[Gil-geum gasps] Uh…

808
00:45:19.133 --> 00:45:21.760
-I don't think you should that.
-The knife could be threatening.

809
00:45:21.844 --> 00:45:24.471
-[Sim] Mm-hmm.
-We'll just cut it before we serve it.

810
00:45:24.555 --> 00:45:27.724
Wow, miss, what clever words you use.
Say it once more?

811
00:45:27.808 --> 00:45:29.226
"Cu-cutting?"

812
00:45:29.309 --> 00:45:30.436
[Bong-sik] "Cah-tting"?

813
00:45:30.519 --> 00:45:31.937
[Sim] "Cotung, cotung."

814
00:45:32.813 --> 00:45:33.814
[Gil-geum] Oh…

815
00:45:36.984 --> 00:45:38.402
Hmm?

816
00:45:42.239 --> 00:45:43.740
[Bong-sik groans]

817
00:45:43.824 --> 00:45:46.660
-[Sim] That looks really good.
-[Chu-wol] Her Grace has arrived!

818
00:45:46.743 --> 00:45:47.953
[Sim] Right. [groans]

819
00:45:48.036 --> 00:45:49.663
[Bong-sik] Oh, my.

820
00:45:49.746 --> 00:45:51.331
[clears throat]

821
00:45:54.960 --> 00:45:56.753
Is the food ready?

822
00:45:56.837 --> 00:45:59.339
Yes, Your Grace, the meal preparation
has been completed.

823
00:45:59.423 --> 00:46:00.507
Mmm.

824
00:46:12.936 --> 00:46:14.313
Mmm.

825
00:46:14.396 --> 00:46:16.732
Yes, this will do. Well done.

826
00:46:16.815 --> 00:46:18.400
[scoffs]

827
00:46:22.821 --> 00:46:26.033
How dare you stare? Do you know
who is currently standing in front of you?

828
00:46:26.116 --> 00:46:27.326
Huh?

829
00:46:27.826 --> 00:46:30.412
Uh… [chuckles] I'm not staring at--

830
00:46:30.496 --> 00:46:32.039
Are you talking back to me right now?

831
00:46:32.122 --> 00:46:35.292
Talking back? Oh, no, I wasn't trying to--

832
00:46:35.375 --> 00:46:36.752
That's enough.

833
00:46:37.377 --> 00:46:41.006
It's natural for one's eyes to be drawn
to someone who is this beautiful.

834
00:46:42.758 --> 00:46:43.967
[chuckles]

835
00:46:46.929 --> 00:46:48.096
-[gasps]
-Oh!

836
00:46:49.056 --> 00:46:50.432
Ah!

837
00:46:50.516 --> 00:46:53.936
[Mok-ju sighs, clicks tongue]
What a mess you have made.

838
00:46:54.019 --> 00:46:56.522
[Chu-wol] Your Grace, I will prepare
a change of clothes for you.

839
00:46:56.605 --> 00:46:59.149
-Let us stop at Jahongwon before we go.
-Let us hurry.

840
00:46:59.233 --> 00:47:00.442
[Chu-wol] Yes, Your Grace.

841
00:47:05.030 --> 00:47:07.449
Oh, my God.

842
00:47:09.326 --> 00:47:12.329
Seriously, the plating was perfect.

843
00:47:12.412 --> 00:47:14.456
-Hurry, let's do it again!
-Yes!

844
00:47:21.463 --> 00:47:25.217
So, how is His Majesty's condition?
Is he healthy?

845
00:47:25.300 --> 00:47:28.136
I have examined to see whether or not
his stomach has weakened

846
00:47:28.220 --> 00:47:32.599
in any way from fasting…
but he is in very good health.

847
00:47:32.683 --> 00:47:35.310
However, to prevent his stomach from…
growing upset,

848
00:47:35.394 --> 00:47:38.564
it would be best to avoid cold foods
for the time being.

849
00:47:38.647 --> 00:47:40.440
[sighs]

850
00:47:40.524 --> 00:47:43.026
Then how about taking
some bellflower root juice, huh?

851
00:47:43.110 --> 00:47:44.987
Or he could have braised beans
after his meal?

852
00:47:45.070 --> 00:47:48.740
Those seems like excellent choices,
Your Highness. [chuckles]

853
00:47:48.824 --> 00:47:51.785
Your Majesty,
what are your thoughts on this?

854
00:47:51.868 --> 00:47:55.372
Well, Uncle, you don't even brave showing
your face in the royal kitchen.

855
00:47:56.331 --> 00:47:59.751
Yet you seem curiously sincere
only once a month, during jinhu.

856
00:48:00.419 --> 00:48:02.004
[chuckles]

857
00:48:02.087 --> 00:48:04.006
As the superintendent of Saongwon,

858
00:48:04.089 --> 00:48:07.634
it is only right that I care for things
like your health, Your Majesty.

859
00:48:07.718 --> 00:48:10.012
You only emphasize
your roles at times like this.

860
00:48:10.095 --> 00:48:13.348
Then, I will make sure today
to go and inform the royal kitchen.

861
00:48:14.516 --> 00:48:15.517
[chuckles]

862
00:48:30.782 --> 00:48:33.118
What are you doing? Announce us right now.

863
00:48:35.287 --> 00:48:37.623
Lunch is ready, Your Majesty.

864
00:48:38.248 --> 00:48:39.374
Bring it in.

865
00:49:11.156 --> 00:49:12.699
[Mal-im clears throat]

866
00:49:12.783 --> 00:49:15.202
I have wondered, have you been well,
Your Majesty?

867
00:49:15.285 --> 00:49:17.829
It has been a long time, has it not,
Your Highness?

868
00:49:22.542 --> 00:49:24.753
Fourth Junior Consort, what is all this?

869
00:49:24.836 --> 00:49:27.130
Well, I was made aware
that your jinhu was today,

870
00:49:27.214 --> 00:49:30.842
so I prepared lunch for you
in great haste. I hope you enjoy.

871
00:49:30.926 --> 00:49:32.928
Did you make all of this yourself?

872
00:49:33.011 --> 00:49:35.555
I prepared a special meal for Your Majesty

873
00:49:35.639 --> 00:49:39.768
and of course, for your special guest,
His Highness, with the help of Cook Maeng.

874
00:49:39.851 --> 00:49:43.605
And that other lunch is the result
of the chief royal cook

875
00:49:43.689 --> 00:49:45.440
and the rest
of the royal kitchen's efforts.

876
00:49:45.524 --> 00:49:47.025
Then should you not have talked
to the royal kitchen

877
00:49:47.109 --> 00:49:49.444
and arranged for a single lunch meal?

878
00:49:49.528 --> 00:49:52.322
[Ji-young] I knew it.
I knew he would scold you.

879
00:49:52.406 --> 00:49:53.740
Ooh, that feels so good.

880
00:49:53.824 --> 00:49:56.076
I made myself clear and sent instructions,

881
00:49:56.159 --> 00:50:00.372
but when I went to the royal kitchen,
another lunch had already been prepared.

882
00:50:00.455 --> 00:50:03.125
Perhaps the chief royal cook
considered my food

883
00:50:03.208 --> 00:50:05.919
insufficient for a king to eat for lunch.

884
00:50:06.837 --> 00:50:10.132
[Ji-young] Seriously?
Why is she acting so childish?

885
00:50:11.425 --> 00:50:12.592
[scoffs]

886
00:50:14.469 --> 00:50:16.680
The chief royal cook likely acted that way

887
00:50:16.763 --> 00:50:19.224
because there was no direct order
from my quarters.

888
00:50:20.142 --> 00:50:21.143
Huh.

889
00:50:21.768 --> 00:50:24.563
Then please,
continue the lunch as it was planned.

890
00:50:24.646 --> 00:50:28.692
I hope you will look upon my humble food
as a sign of my sincerity.

891
00:50:29.359 --> 00:50:30.360
All right. I shall.

892
00:50:30.444 --> 00:50:32.446
[chuckles] Your Majesty,

893
00:50:32.529 --> 00:50:36.992
do look upon Her Grace's sincerity.
It is admirability at its finest.

894
00:50:37.075 --> 00:50:40.287
[clears throat]
Are you the chief royal cook then?

895
00:50:41.246 --> 00:50:44.374
Yes, this is the new chief royal cook
of the royal kitchen.

896
00:50:44.458 --> 00:50:48.295
The palace is full of talk surrounding
the new chief royal cook Yeon.

897
00:50:48.378 --> 00:50:49.504
Nice to meet you.

898
00:50:50.130 --> 00:50:52.215
[Ji-young]
Hello. I heard you were coming today

899
00:50:52.299 --> 00:50:55.677
and prepared a special dish.
I do hope it suits your taste.

900
00:50:55.761 --> 00:50:59.055
Oh, I'm looking forward to it. [chuckles]

901
00:50:59.931 --> 00:51:03.769
An exceptional beauty,
and a fearless tone.

902
00:51:04.436 --> 00:51:05.771
[chuckles]

903
00:51:07.063 --> 00:51:08.106
Taste the meal.

904
00:51:08.190 --> 00:51:09.566
Yes, Your Majesty.

905
00:51:22.162 --> 00:51:24.581
Is this… chogyetang?

906
00:51:24.664 --> 00:51:27.542
This baekmajatang
is made with young hen meat.

907
00:51:27.626 --> 00:51:30.378
The meat and ground majang are simmered
for a long time to make the broth,

908
00:51:30.462 --> 00:51:33.048
which is served cold
with shredded chicken.

909
00:51:33.131 --> 00:51:36.051
It is meant to protect the five organs,
ward off the summer heat,

910
00:51:36.134 --> 00:51:37.803
and also act as a medicine.

911
00:51:37.886 --> 00:51:40.597
I made it especially
for Your Majesty to feel better.

912
00:51:40.680 --> 00:51:44.392
Hmm. I was told by the doctor
to avoid cold foods.

913
00:51:45.018 --> 00:51:46.269
Ah…

914
00:51:48.772 --> 00:51:49.940
[coughs]

915
00:51:50.023 --> 00:51:53.235
Then tell me,
what is the name of this dish here?

916
00:51:54.861 --> 00:51:57.739
They refer to this dish as
hwangjagye hondontang, I believe.

917
00:51:57.823 --> 00:51:59.991
-Oh…
-[Mok-ju] The broth is made from

918
00:52:00.075 --> 00:52:02.953
simmering the bones
of a yellow-feathered hen.

919
00:52:03.036 --> 00:52:05.622
A defining characteristic of the dish
is the seasoned chicken filling

920
00:52:05.705 --> 00:52:07.582
wrapped into dumplings and boiled.

921
00:52:07.666 --> 00:52:10.418
I had this dish prepared
for your Highness's stomach,

922
00:52:10.502 --> 00:52:12.671
-as you are an avid drinker.
-[Jesan] Hmm…

923
00:52:12.754 --> 00:52:15.340
The smell is very light
and not overpowering.

924
00:52:15.423 --> 00:52:17.008
[both chuckle]

925
00:52:30.021 --> 00:52:31.147
Hmm.

926
00:52:32.148 --> 00:52:35.235
However, both dishes here
are only made with hen meat.

927
00:52:35.318 --> 00:52:37.696
Yes. However they are adorned
on the outside,

928
00:52:37.779 --> 00:52:39.823
all females are alike on the inside.

929
00:52:40.657 --> 00:52:43.451
I hope these dishes will allow you
to consider this lesson

930
00:52:43.535 --> 00:52:45.996
and distance yourself
from those who keep you

931
00:52:46.079 --> 00:52:48.665
from your royal ancestral rites
and state affairs.

932
00:52:50.709 --> 00:52:55.630
[Ji-young] Wait… then am I the hen?
Huh, this is so ridiculous.

933
00:52:55.714 --> 00:53:00.427
Your intention is truly admirable.
I will keep that in mind going forward.

934
00:53:00.510 --> 00:53:02.888
[Jesan clears throat] I am intrigued now.

935
00:53:02.971 --> 00:53:06.558
What is the dish that the chief
royal cook has specially prepared?

936
00:53:06.641 --> 00:53:08.643
Yes, what have you prepared for us today?

937
00:53:08.727 --> 00:53:09.936
[chuckles]

938
00:53:10.020 --> 00:53:15.317
The dish I prepared for you today is a
German favorite, schnitzel, Your Majesty.

939
00:53:15.400 --> 00:53:17.360
Uh… "Sunite-teh"?

940
00:53:19.821 --> 00:53:21.406
[Jesan laughs]

941
00:53:21.489 --> 00:53:23.658
Oh, my goodness. [clears throat]

942
00:53:23.742 --> 00:53:27.329
Your Majesty, that is not it. Sun-chae.

943
00:53:27.412 --> 00:53:29.456
VEGETABLE FROM THE LOTUS FAMILY
SERVED TO THE ROYAL COURT

944
00:53:29.539 --> 00:53:32.125
You may not know it well,
but there is a vegetable called sunchae.

945
00:53:32.208 --> 00:53:35.295
It is known to look similar
to a lotus leaf. Sun-chae.

946
00:53:35.378 --> 00:53:37.839
-Oh, sunchae, right?
-[laughs]

947
00:53:39.049 --> 00:53:41.092
-Oh. Wait.
-Hmm?

948
00:53:46.514 --> 00:53:49.768
Wha-What…
What did you say was the name… again?

949
00:53:50.560 --> 00:53:52.062
Beef schnitzel, Your Majesty.

950
00:53:52.145 --> 00:53:53.855
Bee-bu-shoe-sell?

951
00:53:54.648 --> 00:53:56.316
[Yi Heon laughs]

952
00:53:56.399 --> 00:53:59.361
Uncle, really. Did you not
just say it was a sunchae meal?

953
00:53:59.444 --> 00:54:01.363
[Jesan clears throat]

954
00:54:01.446 --> 00:54:05.116
Schnitzel is a dish
where the meat is pounded thin,

955
00:54:05.200 --> 00:54:07.661
then it's coated in flour,
and fried in oil.

956
00:54:08.703 --> 00:54:11.831
I recommend dipping it in the sweet
and sour fruit jam you have here.

957
00:54:13.667 --> 00:54:14.668
The key to the meal.

958
00:54:15.835 --> 00:54:19.714
And it is a protein-rich dish that helps
with mental and physical recovery.

959
00:54:19.798 --> 00:54:22.384
And seeing how Your Majesty
has skipped meals for a while,

960
00:54:22.467 --> 00:54:26.096
I made sure to use particularly
fresh beef to prepare this special dish

961
00:54:26.179 --> 00:54:28.223
that balances taste and nutrition.

962
00:54:29.975 --> 00:54:32.644
[Mok-ju] Yet again, another strange dish.

963
00:54:32.727 --> 00:54:35.689
Unfortunately for you,
it will not work today.

964
00:54:35.772 --> 00:54:38.191
-[Yi Heon] Taste it.
-[Mal-im] Yes, Your Majesty.

965
00:54:44.114 --> 00:54:45.573
[crunching]

966
00:54:48.702 --> 00:54:49.786
[chuckles]

967
00:54:50.870 --> 00:54:51.955
Hmm.

968
00:54:52.872 --> 00:54:54.207
[scoffs]

969
00:54:56.084 --> 00:54:57.711
[Yi Heon] It looks almost as though

970
00:54:57.794 --> 00:54:59.963
the blackberry has blossomed
on top of the pancake.

971
00:55:00.046 --> 00:55:01.673
It is quite a work of art.

972
00:55:01.756 --> 00:55:03.174
-[chuckles]
-[Jesan] Mmm.

973
00:55:03.258 --> 00:55:06.970
This white sprinkled thing
on top is milk? Or what exactly?

974
00:55:07.053 --> 00:55:09.014
That's tartar sauce on top for you.

975
00:55:09.097 --> 00:55:12.017
It has a sweet and sour taste
to it, but it's still creamy.

976
00:55:12.809 --> 00:55:15.103
If you wish to make it
a little sweeter instead,

977
00:55:15.186 --> 00:55:17.063
you can dip it
in the raspberry jam next to it.

978
00:55:17.147 --> 00:55:20.358
"The taro painting"? In the jam… What?

979
00:55:20.984 --> 00:55:22.861
[Jesan] Oh, the raspberry.

980
00:55:22.944 --> 00:55:26.781
Uh, the blackberry-- Black jam water?
[chuckles]

981
00:55:26.865 --> 00:55:28.199
The blackberry jam water.

982
00:55:28.283 --> 00:55:30.618
You can just take it and dip it like this.

983
00:55:30.702 --> 00:55:32.328
So you dip it and eat it.

984
00:55:32.412 --> 00:55:34.414
Dip and eat it?

985
00:55:35.248 --> 00:55:37.709
Dip it, and eat it.

986
00:55:37.792 --> 00:55:39.169
Like-Like this way?

987
00:55:39.252 --> 00:55:41.212
Yes, that's perfect.

988
00:55:47.719 --> 00:55:48.762
[exhales deeply]

989
00:55:51.014 --> 00:55:52.640
[crunching]

990
00:56:10.033 --> 00:56:13.620
What is this? This flavor is…

991
00:56:19.834 --> 00:56:21.044
[chuckles]

992
00:56:21.127 --> 00:56:25.048
It's a crispy outside, but the inside
is so succulent and not overly chewy.

993
00:56:25.924 --> 00:56:26.925
You're right!

994
00:56:27.008 --> 00:56:30.512
Your Majesty, that's what we call
"crispy outside, chewy in the middle."

995
00:56:30.595 --> 00:56:32.764
Crisp and chewy, did you say?

996
00:56:33.973 --> 00:56:35.892
That is it! I've got it!

997
00:56:35.975 --> 00:56:39.729
It means, "See? The inside is chewy."

998
00:56:39.813 --> 00:56:41.689
Does it not? I think it does. [laughing]

999
00:56:41.773 --> 00:56:44.526
Yes. It's basically
a shortened way of saying

1000
00:56:44.609 --> 00:56:47.737
that "The inside is chewy
and the outside is crispy."

1001
00:56:47.821 --> 00:56:49.280
-Crispy out, chewy in.
-[scoffs]

1002
00:56:49.364 --> 00:56:51.741
My word, there is no need
to shorten everything.

1003
00:56:52.408 --> 00:56:54.577
Yes, "NSE."

1004
00:56:55.870 --> 00:56:57.789
[Ji-young] Look at her attacking me
for no reason.

1005
00:56:57.872 --> 00:57:00.083
Hey, Mok-ju, two can play at that game.

1006
00:57:00.166 --> 00:57:01.793
[sighs]

1007
00:57:06.297 --> 00:57:07.590
Hmm.

1008
00:57:09.092 --> 00:57:11.678
Your Highness, and Your Majesty.

1009
00:57:11.761 --> 00:57:14.722
Try the vegetable
on the side as well, please.

1010
00:57:14.806 --> 00:57:16.224
[Yi Heon] Oh, you mean this?

1011
00:57:16.307 --> 00:57:18.017
Yes. It's burdock root.

1012
00:57:18.101 --> 00:57:22.147
And if you have it together, it helps cut
through the greasiness of the meat.

1013
00:57:23.064 --> 00:57:25.316
[gags] Oh, that's bitter.

1014
00:57:25.400 --> 00:57:27.402
It is bitter, just like Uncle said.

1015
00:57:28.236 --> 00:57:32.574
Usually, when people eat their veggies,
they only eat the leaves and the stems,

1016
00:57:32.657 --> 00:57:34.742
avoiding the bitter taste of the roots.

1017
00:57:35.493 --> 00:57:38.413
But actually,
the roots contain the most nutrients.

1018
00:57:38.496 --> 00:57:41.624
I worry that you might end up misjudging
someone based on their appearance,

1019
00:57:41.708 --> 00:57:44.461
and act on that,
without considering their roots.

1020
00:57:45.462 --> 00:57:47.422
Do you understand, Your Majesty?

1021
00:57:49.257 --> 00:57:50.341
[scoffs]

1022
00:57:50.425 --> 00:57:52.469
[Mok-ju] How dare you, you wench?

1023
00:57:54.554 --> 00:57:56.973
[scoffs, clears throat]

1024
00:57:58.683 --> 00:58:01.644
Like you just said, it is indeed bitter,

1025
00:58:01.728 --> 00:58:05.064
but it does seem to actually
cleanse the palate quite well.

1026
00:58:05.148 --> 00:58:06.357
[chuckles]

1027
00:58:06.441 --> 00:58:08.735
I will always remember the roots,
just like you said.

1028
00:58:09.986 --> 00:58:11.404
Your Majesty. Thank you.

1029
00:58:12.238 --> 00:58:15.283
Now, shall we get into our meal or not?

1030
00:58:15.366 --> 00:58:17.785
Yes, please. Enjoy, Uncle.

1031
00:58:17.869 --> 00:58:19.204
Thank you.

1032
00:58:24.209 --> 00:58:26.544
Hmm. [chuckles]

1033
00:58:32.509 --> 00:58:34.219
-[chuckles]
-[gasps]

1034
00:58:38.348 --> 00:58:39.516
Here we are.

1035
00:58:44.020 --> 00:58:45.939
[chuckling]

1036
00:58:49.943 --> 00:58:51.110
Hmm.

1037
00:58:54.155 --> 00:58:55.740
Mmm!

1038
00:59:03.873 --> 00:59:08.253
[Mok-ju] Mark my words, I will never,
ever let you get away with this.

1039
00:59:08.336 --> 00:59:11.339
[Ji-young] Aw, I bet you're
really pissed off now. Watch yourself.

1040
00:59:11.422 --> 00:59:15.510
You might be a notorious villain,
but I'm from the future,

1041
00:59:15.593 --> 00:59:17.303
and I know more than you do.

1042
00:59:22.684 --> 00:59:24.394
Oh, that was delicious.

1043
00:59:28.231 --> 00:59:29.816
-[sighs]
-[Jesan exhales deeply]

1044
00:59:29.899 --> 00:59:32.652
I am so utterly delighted
to see you enjoy your meal so much.

1045
00:59:32.735 --> 00:59:36.406
-It is truly joyous, Your Majesty.
-[chuckles]

1046
00:59:36.489 --> 00:59:39.325
Your Majesty, we should bestow
a great reward for these two.

1047
00:59:39.409 --> 00:59:41.744
Her Grace and for Cook Yeon.

1048
00:59:42.787 --> 00:59:46.124
Is there anything you desire
at this time, Your Grace?

1049
00:59:46.207 --> 00:59:50.086
The only thing I wish for right now is
the health and safety of Your Majesty.

1050
00:59:50.753 --> 00:59:56.009
[groans] You are truly virtuous and wise,
well beyond your years, Your Grace.

1051
00:59:56.092 --> 00:59:58.094
Thank you, Fourth Junior Consort.

1052
00:59:58.845 --> 01:00:01.973
Cook Yeon, is there anything
you desire as well?

1053
01:00:02.056 --> 01:00:05.059
[stammers] What I desire? I'd like a…

1054
01:00:05.893 --> 01:00:08.813
[Ji-young] I can't talk about my bag
in front of that woman.

1055
01:00:10.440 --> 01:00:11.774
Well, I…

1056
01:00:12.483 --> 01:00:15.862
It is known far and wide that
women are weak to gifts, Your Majesty.

1057
01:00:15.945 --> 01:00:17.155
What does she like?

1058
01:00:17.238 --> 01:00:19.907
The key is to find out
what that is and present that.

1059
01:00:21.034 --> 01:00:23.703
Yes, please speak up.
What is it that you desire?

1060
01:00:25.955 --> 01:00:26.956
Truthfully…

1061
01:00:28.916 --> 01:00:31.544
whenever I see fresh,
new ingredients to make food with,

1062
01:00:31.628 --> 01:00:34.339
I feel really happy
and it makes my heart flutter.

1063
01:00:34.422 --> 01:00:35.548
[scoffs]

1064
01:00:35.632 --> 01:00:39.636
And the Saongwon has it all,
so I will just accept your sentiment.

1065
01:00:40.136 --> 01:00:42.972
[scoffs]
Just some vegetables are enough for you?

1066
01:00:43.056 --> 01:00:45.516
-As expected of the chief royal cook.
-[chuckles]

1067
01:00:45.600 --> 01:00:49.729
It seems as though she is hiding the fact
that she wants something very big.

1068
01:00:50.647 --> 01:00:54.484
[Ji-young] Hey, you're the one who wants
something big, not the other way around.

1069
01:00:54.567 --> 01:00:56.778
[chuckles] Oh, is that so?

1070
01:00:56.861 --> 01:00:59.197
Uh, no.
I… No, I really don't want anything.

1071
01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:02.325
I will you send you,
as Superintendent of Saongwon,

1072
01:01:02.408 --> 01:01:04.535
any and all sizes of vegetables you want.

1073
01:01:04.619 --> 01:01:06.162
[Jesan, Yi Heon laughing]

1074
01:01:21.135 --> 01:01:22.220
[exhales sharply]

1075
01:01:42.031 --> 01:01:43.950
BEEF

1076
01:01:44.784 --> 01:01:46.494
[Ji-young]
Usually, when people eat their veggies,

1077
01:01:46.577 --> 01:01:50.915
they only eat the leaves and the stems,
avoiding the bitter taste of the roots.

1078
01:01:51.791 --> 01:01:54.419
But actually,
the roots contain the most nutrients.

1079
01:01:54.502 --> 01:01:56.921
[Yi Heon scoffs]
She truly is bright and wise

1080
01:01:57.004 --> 01:01:59.215
in every situation I have seen her in.

1081
01:01:59.298 --> 01:02:02.301
Your Majesty! Today's theme
for the competition was family.

1082
01:02:02.385 --> 01:02:04.637
Wouldn't cutting off their arms be
a great breach of respect

1083
01:02:04.721 --> 01:02:07.014
and loyalty towards Her Royal Highness?

1084
01:02:07.098 --> 01:02:09.809
[Yi Heon] She is kind enough to spare
the other cooks who competed against her,

1085
01:02:09.892 --> 01:02:11.477
simply out of kindness.

1086
01:02:16.524 --> 01:02:19.193
The true definition of a virtuous woman.

1087
01:02:23.990 --> 01:02:27.326
CRISPY OUTSIDE, CHEWY INSIDE

1088
01:02:27.410 --> 01:02:30.455
[Seo-hong] The delegation will be arriving
to the palace any day now.

1089
01:02:30.538 --> 01:02:32.957
But my word,
why can't they just stop chattering on?

1090
01:02:33.040 --> 01:02:36.502
Why don't you get a little rest?
I will take a look at them for you.

1091
01:02:36.586 --> 01:02:39.088
You are the epitome
of a filial son, aren't you?

1092
01:02:39.172 --> 01:02:41.591
-[bones crack]
-[groans]

1093
01:02:41.674 --> 01:02:43.301
Goodness gracious.

1094
01:02:43.384 --> 01:02:45.428
[sighs] By the way, Son,

1095
01:02:45.511 --> 01:02:48.806
how are things going
with the chief royal cook and His Majesty?

1096
01:02:48.890 --> 01:02:52.101
Is the plan you devised working well?
How is it going? Go on.

1097
01:02:53.060 --> 01:02:56.355
Father, His Majesty is now
in the throes of contemplating

1098
01:02:56.439 --> 01:02:57.982
what gift to give to Cook Yeon.

1099
01:02:58.065 --> 01:03:01.235
If he is truly contemplating giving
a gift to her,

1100
01:03:01.319 --> 01:03:03.404
does that mean they both like each other?

1101
01:03:03.488 --> 01:03:05.823
We know that is your area
of expertise, Son.

1102
01:03:05.907 --> 01:03:09.619
So gently suggest a gift
that will lead her heart to His Majesty's.

1103
01:03:09.702 --> 01:03:12.205
I should suggest a gift to
His Majesty for Cook…

1104
01:03:14.916 --> 01:03:16.417
-Ah.
-Bu…

1105
01:03:16.501 --> 01:03:18.002
Have you thought of a good gift already?

1106
01:03:18.085 --> 01:03:20.755
I do know of a gift
that the gwinyeo is searching for.

1107
01:03:20.838 --> 01:03:23.174
-And what is that?
-When we were bringing Cook Yeon

1108
01:03:23.257 --> 01:03:25.092
from the Gyeonggi Governor's Office,

1109
01:03:25.176 --> 01:03:28.095
she confided in me that she had lost
a knapsack in Salgoji Forest,

1110
01:03:28.179 --> 01:03:30.056
so I went and got it
and I have kept it safe.

1111
01:03:30.139 --> 01:03:34.560
A knapsack? So what? Or does it hold
something that could be important to us?

1112
01:03:34.644 --> 01:03:36.270
She was so desperate to find it,

1113
01:03:36.354 --> 01:03:38.856
I thought it might contain gold
or something like that.

1114
01:03:39.565 --> 01:03:40.900
Oh, my goodness.

1115
01:03:43.694 --> 01:03:46.364
"Daehanminguk passport."

1116
01:03:46.447 --> 01:03:48.699
Daehan-minguk.

1117
01:03:48.783 --> 01:03:51.786
Daehan minguk.

1118
01:03:56.290 --> 01:03:58.167
[gasps] Why is the gwinyeo in here?

1119
01:03:58.251 --> 01:04:01.379
But it was filled with all kinds
of strange items I have never seen.

1120
01:04:01.462 --> 01:04:06.717
Well, then it should be fine even if
you give it back to her from his Majesty.

1121
01:04:06.801 --> 01:04:07.844
At any rate,

1122
01:04:07.927 --> 01:04:10.555
if it is something
that the gwinyeo desperately needs,

1123
01:04:10.638 --> 01:04:13.307
hurry and give it as your suggestion.

1124
01:04:13.391 --> 01:04:14.392
Yes, Father.

1125
01:04:14.475 --> 01:04:16.727
Having you point out things
clearly like that

1126
01:04:16.811 --> 01:04:18.938
definitely helps my mind
become sharp again.

1127
01:04:19.021 --> 01:04:20.398
[laughs]

1128
01:04:21.983 --> 01:04:26.153
It is exactly the right gift.
His Majesty returns the bag to Cook Yeon.

1129
01:04:28.322 --> 01:04:29.991
Their relationship will only grow.

1130
01:04:30.074 --> 01:04:31.909
Oh, your bag, is it?

1131
01:04:33.911 --> 01:04:35.246
[both laugh]

1132
01:04:36.163 --> 01:04:37.164
BONGDEOKGUNG

1133
01:04:37.248 --> 01:04:38.374
[Yi Heon] The bag?

1134
01:04:38.457 --> 01:04:39.792
Yes, Your Majesty.

1135
01:04:40.501 --> 01:04:43.004
It is what Cook Yeon
was desperately looking for.

1136
01:04:47.258 --> 01:04:50.761
Oh, this is it? She was claiming
that it came from the future.

1137
01:04:51.262 --> 01:04:52.388
Your Majesty is correct.

1138
01:04:55.975 --> 01:04:58.311
And why did you manage to have her bag?

1139
01:04:58.394 --> 01:05:00.813
The day after Your Majesty
shot the bag off the cliff's edge,

1140
01:05:00.897 --> 01:05:02.815
I had my subordinates retrieve it for me.

1141
01:05:04.734 --> 01:05:08.487
If you present this to Cook Yeon
as a gift, she will definitely be pleased.

1142
01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:10.364
Oh, you brilliant man.

1143
01:05:11.157 --> 01:05:12.491
[laughs]

1144
01:05:13.701 --> 01:05:15.536
Hold on. How did you know

1145
01:05:15.620 --> 01:05:19.248
that I was searching for
a gift for Cook Yeon? Who told you that?

1146
01:05:23.044 --> 01:05:25.421
No one told me. I'm that good.

1147
01:05:26.964 --> 01:05:29.383
[clears throat] Well, thank you for this.

1148
01:05:29.467 --> 01:05:33.512
Oh. One other thing,
about the delegation coming here.

1149
01:05:33.596 --> 01:05:35.056
Yes? What about it?

1150
01:05:35.139 --> 01:05:36.641
The chief envoy, Director Woo Gon,

1151
01:05:36.724 --> 01:05:38.851
he has brought along
three first-class cooks with him.

1152
01:05:38.935 --> 01:05:40.144
Three cooks?

1153
01:05:40.227 --> 01:05:42.897
Has word of my particular taste
reached them as well?

1154
01:05:42.980 --> 01:05:44.315
Do you think that is why?

1155
01:05:44.398 --> 01:05:47.360
It seems that they want
to win your palate over again,

1156
01:05:47.443 --> 01:05:49.403
I believe,
in their goal of gaining something.

1157
01:05:49.487 --> 01:05:50.738
What could they want?

1158
01:05:50.821 --> 01:05:53.908
We cannot know at present, but
it will likely be a significant request,

1159
01:05:53.991 --> 01:05:56.118
since they are an envoy of a great nation.

1160
01:05:56.953 --> 01:06:00.998
Things that will be overwhelming for us
to bear. It's only guesses, Your Majesty.

1161
01:06:01.082 --> 01:06:06.003
So they are bringing three first-class
cooks with a significant request.

1162
01:06:07.546 --> 01:06:08.547
[sighs]

1163
01:06:08.631 --> 01:06:10.967
BYEOKJEGWAN

1164
01:06:16.055 --> 01:06:17.056
Hmm.

1165
01:06:18.140 --> 01:06:21.602
Ask him for us
if the food is not to his liking.

1166
01:06:21.686 --> 01:06:24.605
[in Mandarin] My lord,
are you dissatisfied with this food?

1167
01:06:25.523 --> 01:06:30.695
How can you serve something
like this to eat?

1168
01:06:31.737 --> 01:06:34.573
[in English] Uh, he says
that he does not want to eat the meal.

1169
01:06:34.657 --> 01:06:35.908
Why not?

1170
01:06:37.243 --> 01:06:40.037
YU KUN: CHIEF ENVOY OF MING

1171
01:06:46.168 --> 01:06:48.212
TANG BAILOR:
MASTER OF SICHUAN CUISINE

1172
01:07:47.229 --> 01:07:49.982
-[in Mandarin] Try it.
-[in English] He says to try it.

1173
01:07:50.066 --> 01:07:51.650
[Hyeong-min clears throat]

1174
01:07:52.735 --> 01:07:55.529
[gasps] Hold on, is this…

1175
01:07:55.613 --> 01:08:00.076
[in Mandarin] Do not be surprised.
He has cut the tofu as thin as threads

1176
01:08:00.159 --> 01:08:03.662
and made it into a blossoming flower.

1177
01:08:03.746 --> 01:08:05.623
[in English] He says not to be surprised.

1178
01:08:05.706 --> 01:08:09.293
He's cut the tofu as thin as threads
to make it a blossoming flower.

1179
01:08:09.376 --> 01:08:10.503
[Hyeong-min] Hmm.

1180
01:08:18.636 --> 01:08:19.637
Hmm.

1181
01:08:20.638 --> 01:08:21.847
[cackles]

1182
01:08:22.807 --> 01:08:28.437
[in Mandarin]
This is the cuisine of a great nation.

1183
01:08:29.230 --> 01:08:33.526
Go and tell the King of Joseon
that I cannot eat Joseon's food. [scoffs]

1184
01:08:38.364 --> 01:08:41.659
[gasps, speaks in English]
Wow, I had no idea this existed.

1185
01:08:42.493 --> 01:08:44.787
-This place is called Jangwonseo.
-Jangwonseo.

1186
01:08:44.870 --> 01:08:46.455
OFFICE IN CHARGE OF HORTICULTURE

1187
01:08:46.539 --> 01:08:47.581
Go ahead.

1188
01:08:48.082 --> 01:08:52.044
It's where the flowers, fruits, and
vegetables for the royal family are grown.

1189
01:08:52.878 --> 01:08:55.631
[chuckles] Here we are.

1190
01:08:57.258 --> 01:08:58.634
[gasps]

1191
01:08:58.717 --> 01:09:04.807
Wow! Oh, Jangwonseo! The world's
first greenhouse and I'm in it!

1192
01:09:04.890 --> 01:09:07.351
I read about this in the history books.

1193
01:09:07.434 --> 01:09:10.938
Wow, I'm in absolute shock right now.
[gasps]

1194
01:09:14.567 --> 01:09:16.485
Whoa! [gasps]

1195
01:09:16.986 --> 01:09:18.779
It's really an apple tree.

1196
01:09:20.573 --> 01:09:25.077
And even a tangerine tree.
Wow. [laughs] This is unreal.

1197
01:09:27.580 --> 01:09:30.958
Wow. And that smell's unreal. Ah!

1198
01:09:32.543 --> 01:09:34.378
-[chuckles]
-[Yi Heon] Come over here.

1199
01:09:42.344 --> 01:09:43.345
[clears throat]

1200
01:09:47.391 --> 01:09:49.059
You are so unrefined.

1201
01:09:49.143 --> 01:09:52.104
Well, I'm fascinated because
I'm seeing all this for the first time.

1202
01:09:52.188 --> 01:09:54.648
You may use this place freely
for as long as you would like.

1203
01:09:54.732 --> 01:09:56.066
What?

1204
01:09:56.150 --> 01:09:57.693
[clears throat]

1205
01:09:57.776 --> 01:09:59.445
Well, the ingredients must be fresh

1206
01:09:59.528 --> 01:10:01.822
for you to make even
more delicious dishes, correct?

1207
01:10:01.906 --> 01:10:05.034
Oh, um, sort of like a free ticket?

1208
01:10:05.117 --> 01:10:08.621
Well, I, um,
I suppose you could put it like that.

1209
01:10:08.704 --> 01:10:09.705
[chuckles]

1210
01:10:11.874 --> 01:10:12.958
It's my gift.

1211
01:10:14.543 --> 01:10:17.463
-For me? Are you sure?
-[scoffs] Very.

1212
01:10:18.130 --> 01:10:19.590
Please, take a look around.

1213
01:10:24.094 --> 01:10:26.263
[Ji-young chuckles]

1214
01:10:28.766 --> 01:10:32.853
This tree is a pyeondo tree.
It means "dented peach."

1215
01:10:32.937 --> 01:10:37.566
It was offered by a merchant from Persia,
but it's just ornamental. It's inedible.

1216
01:10:38.317 --> 01:10:42.696
[chuckles]
No, it's not. This is edible for sure.

1217
01:10:42.780 --> 01:10:46.325
[chuckles] But it's too astringent
and rather pungent to eat.

1218
01:10:46.408 --> 01:10:50.537
It's true about the fruit, yes.
You can only eat the seeds for this one.

1219
01:10:50.621 --> 01:10:52.706
Where I'm from,
these seeds are everywhere,

1220
01:10:52.790 --> 01:10:55.334
and we call them almonds,
and they're amazing.

1221
01:10:55.417 --> 01:10:57.002
"Ah-ahmomde"?

1222
01:10:57.753 --> 01:10:59.922
[Ji-young chuckling]

1223
01:11:00.005 --> 01:11:02.800
[clears throat]
If you would follow me this way.

1224
01:11:04.885 --> 01:11:05.886
[Ji-young] Hmm.

1225
01:11:07.930 --> 01:11:12.184
This is where we study poisonous plants.
Do not get too close to them.

1226
01:11:16.855 --> 01:11:17.856
[gasps]

1227
01:11:20.234 --> 01:11:23.362
Hold on. Did I not just say they
were poisonous? Do not touch it.

1228
01:11:23.445 --> 01:11:28.617
No, Your-Your Majesty, these-these-
these are all chili peppers!

1229
01:11:28.701 --> 01:11:29.910
"Gotcho"?

1230
01:11:29.994 --> 01:11:32.121
I can make chili pepper powder now!

1231
01:11:33.455 --> 01:11:34.456
No, what…

1232
01:11:35.165 --> 01:11:36.166
Whoa!

1233
01:11:37.543 --> 01:11:39.295
Where did you originally get this?

1234
01:11:39.378 --> 01:11:42.047
A few years ago, there was a shipwreck.

1235
01:11:42.131 --> 01:11:45.426
The Westerner we rescued,
he gave me this as a thank you gift.

1236
01:11:45.509 --> 01:11:49.430
However, it is so spicy and toxic
that some have even died eating it.

1237
01:11:49.513 --> 01:11:52.558
We are currently cultivating them
to use as a poison.

1238
01:11:52.641 --> 01:11:55.894
So they did use them as weapons
in the old days. It was all true!

1239
01:11:55.978 --> 01:11:57.438
Oh, this is good.

1240
01:11:57.521 --> 01:12:01.859
I mean, what is this crazy fortune?
A godsend, really!

1241
01:12:01.942 --> 01:12:04.028
-A godsend?
-[squeals]

1242
01:12:04.111 --> 01:12:05.571
Do you like it that much?

1243
01:12:05.654 --> 01:12:08.449
Of course I do! This is insane!

1244
01:12:08.532 --> 01:12:11.660
Then, um, how about this as well?

1245
01:12:13.287 --> 01:12:14.413
What is this?

1246
01:12:15.748 --> 01:12:18.250
I picked it up on the way here.

1247
01:12:18.334 --> 01:12:19.710
-What?
-[clears throat]

1248
01:12:19.793 --> 01:12:22.338
Wait, so, uh, what is this?

1249
01:12:23.047 --> 01:12:24.798
The thing you had been looking for.

1250
01:12:26.091 --> 01:12:27.092
Your bag.

1251
01:12:27.176 --> 01:12:28.177
[gasps]

1252
01:12:28.969 --> 01:12:33.432
Wha-what? [gasps] Is it really?

1253
01:12:35.017 --> 01:12:37.728
Whoa. [squeals, laughs]

1254
01:12:37.811 --> 01:12:43.359
Thank you so much! Thank you!
Thank you so, so much! [exclaims]

1255
01:12:43.442 --> 01:12:45.527
-How did you even find this?
-Oh.

1256
01:12:45.611 --> 01:12:48.989
I, um, I told you already.
I picked it up on the way here.

1257
01:12:49.656 --> 01:12:55.662
Mmm. I'm just so happy.
I can't believe I finally have it again.

1258
01:12:57.039 --> 01:12:58.665
[chuckles]

1259
01:12:58.749 --> 01:13:00.459
Oh, come on. This is nothing.

1260
01:13:00.542 --> 01:13:04.296
How can you just say that it's nothing?
This is so precious to me.

1261
01:13:06.090 --> 01:13:09.176
Are you mad at me anymore?

1262
01:13:10.886 --> 01:13:12.638
For what occurred at Unyeongjeong…

1263
01:13:15.265 --> 01:13:16.767
I do apologize.

1264
01:13:17.434 --> 01:13:22.106
Oh. Are you saying sorry to me right now?

1265
01:13:24.108 --> 01:13:28.862
Then did you give me this
'cause you wanted me to feel better?

1266
01:13:28.946 --> 01:13:31.740
Yes. That's right.

1267
01:13:32.950 --> 01:13:34.660
Wh-why?

1268
01:13:35.577 --> 01:13:36.954
What do you mean, why?

1269
01:13:57.266 --> 01:13:58.308
It is because…

1270
01:13:59.935 --> 01:14:00.978
[Ji-young] No way.

1271
01:14:02.271 --> 01:14:05.107
[Yi Heon] I have begun to see you
for the woman you are.

1272
01:14:05.649 --> 01:14:06.650
[grunts]

1273
01:14:11.363 --> 01:14:14.158
It's simply because…
I like the food you make.

1274
01:14:14.241 --> 01:14:15.242
What?

1275
01:14:16.827 --> 01:14:20.831
Wait, why are you turned away
from me when you're saying that?

1276
01:14:22.082 --> 01:14:25.169
[stammers] Well, I-I mean, uh, well…

1277
01:14:25.252 --> 01:14:27.087
Hold on. [stammers]
Why are you running away?

1278
01:14:27.171 --> 01:14:29.339
So, the thing is, I, uh, um…

1279
01:14:29.423 --> 01:14:31.258
-[exclaims]
-[gasps]

1280
01:14:35.679 --> 01:14:36.805
[both grunt]

1281
01:14:42.811 --> 01:14:44.855
[pop song playing]

1282
01:15:15.219 --> 01:15:18.138
BON APPÉTIT, YOUR MAJESTY

1283
01:15:18.972 --> 01:15:20.432
[Ji-young] I will return now.

1284
01:15:20.516 --> 01:15:24.394
But where do you keep saying
that you'll be returning to?

1285
01:15:24.478 --> 01:15:26.230
[gasps]

1286
01:15:27.356 --> 01:15:30.442
A taste of how good
true Joseon cuisine is.

1287
01:15:30.526 --> 01:15:35.280
How could you just ask me to do this and
have the entire nation's fate in my hands?

1288
01:15:35.364 --> 01:15:37.658
If you really do want to go back,
then win.

1289
01:15:37.741 --> 01:15:39.326
Joseon must lose this competition.
Or else.

1290
01:15:39.409 --> 01:15:41.787
They're more than just cooks, it seems.

1291
01:15:41.870 --> 01:15:43.789
-[Yi Heon] Just one thing then…
-Royal kitchen, let's win!

1292
01:15:43.872 --> 01:15:45.791
…tell them that I also have
a chief royal cook.

1293
01:15:45.874 --> 01:15:48.710
I'm going to show you blazing hot flavor.

